(window.AeroSenseTranslations ||= []).push({"Project Description · Food & Nutrition":"專案介紹 · 食品與營養","Bio-digital olfaction for earlier fungal-risk screening.":"以生物數位嗅覺，提早篩檢真菌風險。","Changes in fungal-associated volatiles may provide a screening window before visible spoilage. AeroSense aims to connect insect OR/Orco receptors in HEK293 cells, a weak-fluorescence reader and a fly-inspired decoder. Current evidence includes endpoint reporter images from one batch, a separate P2 kinetic pilot, reader simulations and computation on external metal-oxide sensor data. The integrated reader-to-decoder chain remains unproven. The intended output is a prompt for follow-up testing, not a mycotoxin concentration or a food-safety clearance.":"真菌相關揮發物的變化，可能在可見腐敗前提供篩檢時機。AeroSense 希望連結 HEK293 細胞中的昆蟲 OR/Orco 受體、微弱螢光讀取器與果蠅啟發的解碼器。目前證據包含一批終點報導螢光影像、另一批 P2 動力學先導試驗、讀取器模擬，以及外部金屬氧化物感測器資料的計算分析。整合的讀取器至解碼器鏈仍未獲驗證。預期輸出是後續查驗的提示，不是真菌毒素濃度或食品安全許可。","Conceptual walkthrough":"概念導覽","Follow an airborne odor from a fruit fly’s natural sense of smell to the system we propose: a living-cell sensor, a reader and a decoder. This walkthrough explains the concept.":"循著空氣中的氣味，從果蠅的天然嗅覺走向我們規劃的系統：活細胞感測器、讀取器與解碼器。這段導覽用來說明概念。","A fruit fly follows an odor.":"一隻果蠅循著氣味前進。","Reach each waypoint, then follow the odor into the proposed sensor.":"抵達各個路標，再循著氣味進入規劃中的感測器。","Start flight":"開始飛行","Skip interactive":"略過互動","WASD / arrows to move · drag joystick on touch · Autopilot available":"WASD／方向鍵移動 · 觸控拖曳搖桿 · 可開啟自動飛行","Movement is paused for reduced motion. The same conceptual path is available as stills.":"為配合減少動態效果的設定，移動已暫停。相同的概念路徑也提供靜態圖像。","Interactive 3D view unavailable on this device.":"此裝置無法使用互動式 3D 檢視。","The interactive was skipped. The same conceptual path is written below, then the technical layers continue.":"已略過互動。下方提供相同概念路徑的文字說明，接著介紹各技術層。","01 · Odor plume":"01 · 氣味羽流","Something changes before we see it.":"在我們看見之前，變化已經開始。","Stored food can release changing volatile patterns as biological and environmental conditions evolve.":"隨著生物與環境條件演變，儲存食品釋出的揮發物模式也可能改變。","02 · Olfaction":"02 · 嗅覺","One odor. Many receptors.":"一種氣味，多個受體。","Fruit-fly olfaction inspired AeroSense to treat odors as patterns rather than single sensor values.":"果蠅嗅覺啟發 AeroSense 將氣味視為一組模式，而不是單一感測器數值。","03 · Receptor / cell":"03 · 受體／細胞","We borrowed the receptor.":"我們借用了受體。","OR / Orco → HEK293 → Ca²⁺ → GCaMP. AeroSense is engineering living cells to translate receptor activation into measurable fluorescence.":"OR／Orco → HEK293 → Ca²⁺ → GCaMP。AeroSense 正在改造活細胞，將受體活化轉換成可量測的螢光。","04 · Reader":"04 · 讀取器","A glow is not yet a measurement.":"發出光，還不等於完成量測。","LIGHT → PD → TIA → ADC. Our reader is designed to convert weak optical responses into usable digital signals. FDM and digital lock-in processing are designed to isolate synchronized signal components from unrelated background variation.":"光 → PD → TIA → ADC。我們的讀取器設計用於將微弱的光學反應轉換成可用的數位訊號。分頻多工（FDM）與數位鎖相處理，旨在從無關的背景變動中分離同步訊號成分。","05 · Odor decoder":"05 · 氣味解碼器","From a distributed response to a sparse pattern.":"從分散的反應，轉為稀疏模式。","Our insect-inspired decoder explores how a distributed receptor-response pattern can become a sparse representation for comparing odors. This scene illustrates the proposed transformation; it is not a measured AeroSense classification result.":"受昆蟲啟發的解碼器，探索如何將分散的受體反應模式轉換為可比較氣味的稀疏表徵。此場景示意的是提議的轉換過程，並非實測的 AeroSense 分類結果。","06 · Decoder / Act":"06 · 解碼器／行動","From signal to a reason to look closer.":"從訊號，找到值得進一步查看的理由。","AeroSense is being developed as an early-screening layer for fungal-associated odor-pattern changes in stored food. Sense → Read → Decode → Act.":"AeroSense 正朝向早期篩檢層開發，用於辨識儲存食品中與真菌相關的氣味模式變化。感測 → 讀取 → 解碼 → 行動。","Follow the signal flight":"循著訊號飛行","VOC pattern in the headspace.":"氣相空間中的 VOC 模式。","Autopilot off":"自動駕駛關閉","Pause":"暫停","Fullscreen":"全螢幕","Exit":"離開","W / ↑ forward · S / ↓ back · A D / ← → steer · fly into the glow":"W／↑ 前進 · S／↓ 後退 · A D／← → 轉向 · 飛向亮光","Drag ↑ forward · ↓ back · ← → steer · release to stop":"拖曳 ↑ 前進 · ↓ 後退 · ← → 轉向 · 放開即停止","Loading":"載入中","Checkpoint":"檢查點","This stage could not load. The conceptual path can continue.":"此階段無法載入，仍可繼續概念路徑。","Continue":"繼續","A stored batch can change before the warning becomes visible.":"儲存中的批次可能在警訊變得可見之前，就已發生變化。","SENSE → READ → DECODE → ACT":"感測 → 讀取 → 解碼 → 行動","Explore biology":"探索生物學","Explore hardware":"探索硬體","Explore model":"探索模型","Exit journey":"離開旅程","Read this journey as text":"以文字閱讀這段旅程","The same path, without the interaction":"不需互動，也能走過相同路徑","AeroSense is being developed to re-encode environmental odor information through biology, electronics, and computation. The walkthrough is a conceptual illustration of that chain, not a simulation of fly behavior and not experimental data.":"AeroSense 正在開發透過生物、電子與運算，重新編碼環境氣味資訊的方法。這段導覽是該鏈結的概念示意，既不是果蠅行為模擬，也不是實驗資料。","Stored food can release changing volatile patterns as biological and environmental conditions evolve. A fruit fly can follow that airborne plume long before the food looks different.":"隨著生物與環境條件演變，儲存食品釋出的揮發物模式也可能改變。果蠅可以在食品外觀發生變化前很久，就循著空氣中的氣味羽流前進。","Fruit-fly olfaction inspired AeroSense to treat odors as patterns rather than single sensor values. The drawing does not reproduce an exact":"果蠅嗅覺啟發 AeroSense 將氣味視為模式，而不是單一感測器數值。這幅圖並未重現精確的","recording.":"記錄。","LIGHT → PD → TIA → ADC. Our reader is designed to convert weak optical responses into usable digital signals.":"光 → PD → TIA → ADC。我們的讀取器設計用於將微弱光學反應轉換成可用的數位訊號。","05 · Decoder":"05 · 解碼器","Compare response patterns.":"比較反應模式。","The illustrated network moves from receptor inputs through contrast processing to a sparse representation. It introduces the fly-inspired decoding design; it is not a measured AeroSense response or classification result.":"示意網路從受體輸入，經過對比處理，再形成稀疏表徵。它介紹受果蠅啟發的解碼設計，並非實測的 AeroSense 反應或分類結果。","AeroSense is being developed as an early-screening layer for fungal-associated odor-pattern changes in stored food. It is not a mycotoxin assay and does not replace formal food-safety testing.":"AeroSense 正朝向早期篩檢層開發，用於辨識儲存食品中與真菌相關的氣味模式變化。它不是真菌毒素檢測，也不取代正式的食品安全檢驗。","JavaScript is off, so the interactive walkthrough cannot run. Expand “Read this journey as text” for the full conceptual story.":"JavaScript 已關閉，因此無法執行互動導覽。展開「以文字閱讀這段旅程」，即可閱讀完整概念故事。","A field guide to AeroSense":"AeroSense 研究指南","Four parts of one sensing chain":"一條感測鏈的四個部分","A reason to look closer.":"一個值得進一步查看的理由。","AeroSense begins with a question: could a changing odor tell us which stored-food samples deserve attention? Each step has its own evidence, and each leaves a different question for the next.":"AeroSense 從一個問題開始：改變的氣味，能否告訴我們哪些儲存食品樣品值得注意？每一步都有自己的證據，也為下一步留下不同的問題。","01 / Borrow a sense":"01／借用一種感官","Why insect receptors?":"為什麼使用昆蟲受體？","Read the biological rationale ↗":"閱讀生物學依據 ↗","02 / Build a signal":"02／建立訊號","Give the cell a readout.":"讓細胞有可讀取的輸出。","Open the sensing layer ↗":"開啟感測層 ↗","03 / Measure carefully":"03／謹慎量測","A glow becomes a measurement.":"讓亮光成為量測值。","Explore the reader ↗":"探索讀取器 ↗","04 / Support a decision":"04／支持決策","Screen, then investigate.":"先篩檢，再調查。","Follow the decision pathway ↗":"跟隨決策路徑 ↗","Four illustrated chapters introduce the project. Follow their links for the design rationale, then explore the experimental images in":"四個圖解章節帶你認識專案。沿著連結了解設計依據，再探索實驗影像，見","and the protocols in":"；實驗流程則見","01 · Context":"01 · 背景","Fungi and deteriorating biological materials release complex mixtures of":"真菌與正在劣化的生物材料，會釋出由多種物質構成的複雜混合物，其中包含","volatile organic compounds (VOCs)":"揮發性有機化合物（VOCs）",". These fingerprints change with species, substrate, environmental conditions, and growth stage, making VOCs promising non-destructive indicators of food and agricultural deterioration":"。這些指紋會隨物種、基質、環境條件與生長階段改變，使 VOCs 成為食品與農產品劣化的潛在非破壞性指標","Gu et al., 2019 — full entry in References.":"Gu 等人，2019 年——完整書目見參考文獻。","Jiarpinijnun et al., 2020 — full entry in References.":"Jiarpinijnun 等人，2020 年——完整書目見參考文獻。","Gu et al., 2022 — full entry in References.":"Gu 等人，2022 年——完整書目見參考文獻。","Sanislav et al., 2025 — full entry in References.":"Sanislav 等人，2025 年——完整書目見參考文獻。",". Timing is the issue: by the time spoilage is obvious, the useful inspection window may already have closed.":"。關鍵在於時機：當腐敗已經明顯可見，有效的檢查時機可能早已錯過。","The screening logic is summarized in":"篩檢邏輯概述於","Figure 1":"圖 1","From invisible change to visible loss.":"從看不見的變化，到看得見的損失。","Conceptual workflow: a change in a stored food batch can alter its volatile profile; receptor responses provide a signal for follow-up inspection, sampling and confirmation. The diagram does not show measured sensitivity and an odor signal does not directly measure aflatoxin.":"概念流程：儲存食品批次的變化可能改變其揮發物輪廓；受體反應提供訊號，供後續檢查、採樣與確認。此圖並未呈現實測靈敏度，氣味訊號也不能直接量測黃麴毒素。","In controlled rice studies, electronic-nose and headspace GC–IMS methods have distinguished fungal contamination before visible growth, including discrimination of inoculated samples within approximately 24–48 hours under controlled experimental conditions":"在受控的稻米研究中，電子鼻與頂空氣相層析－離子遷移譜（GC–IMS）方法，已能在肉眼可見生長之前區分真菌污染；其中包括在受控實驗條件下，約 24–48 小時內區分接種樣品",". Those times are literature results from existing VOC methods. They are not AeroSense measurements.":"。這些時間是既有 VOC 方法的文獻結果，並非 AeroSense 的量測結果。","Powerful analytical methods already exist. GC–MS and related chromatographic methods provide detailed chemical information, while electronic noses can provide rapid pattern-based measurements. We therefore do":"目前已有強大的分析方法。GC–MS 與相關層析方法提供詳細的化學資訊，而電子鼻能快速進行模式量測。因此，我們並","argue that food VOC sensing is an unsolved field. Instead, our project addresses a different engineering question: can biological odorant receptors provide a modular recognition layer that can eventually be coupled to a compact, calibrated measurement system?":"主張食品 VOC 感測是一個尚未解決的領域。我們關注的是另一個工程問題：生物氣味受體能否提供模組化辨識層，最終與小型、經校正的量測系統連接？","Sensor-based electronic noses have shown impressive results across food applications, but reviews continue to identify sensor drift, environmental interference, calibration, odor differentiation, model generalization, and real-world standardization as important challenges":"以感測器為基礎的電子鼻，在食品應用上已有出色成果，但文獻回顧仍指出感測器漂移、環境干擾、校正、氣味區分、模型泛化與實際場域標準化等重要挑戰",". AeroSense explores a complementary biological sensing architecture rather than claiming to replace all existing analytical technologies.":"。AeroSense 探索的是互補的生物感測架構，並不宣稱取代所有既有分析技術。","From a signal to a decision":"從訊號走向決策","For a warehouse or quality-control workflow, the useful question is rarely:":"在倉儲或品質管制流程中，真正有用的問題通常不是：","Not this":"不是這個","“What was the raw sensor voltage?”":"「原始感測器電壓是多少？」","But this":"而是這個","“Has this batch begun to deviate from its reference state, and should we inspect it now?”":"「這批食品是否開始偏離參考狀態，我們現在應該檢查嗎？」","This distinction became central to our project. AeroSense is therefore being designed around":"這項區分成為專案的核心。因此，AeroSense 的設計圍繞著","risk-oriented screening information":"以風險為導向的篩檢資訊",", together with signal quality, confidence, calibration status, and a recommendation for follow-up testing.":"，並同時提供訊號品質、信心水準、校正狀態及後續檢測建議。","AeroSense asks one question: can we engineer a complete sensing chain that turns these invisible chemical changes into reliable and actionable early-warning information?":"AeroSense 提出一個問題：我們能否建構完整的感測鏈，將這些看不見的化學變化，轉換為可靠且可採取行動的早期預警資訊？","Our answer combines three engineering layers around a synthetic-biology core. We use":"我們的做法是以合成生物學為核心，結合三個工程層。我們使用","odorant receptors as programmable biological recognition elements, a dedicated weak-fluorescence reader to recover their optical responses, and a fly-inspired computational framework to decode receptor-response patterns. Together, these modules form a continuous":"氣味受體作為可程式化的生物辨識元件，以專用微弱螢光讀取器擷取光學反應，再以受果蠅啟發的運算架構解碼受體反應模式。這些模組共同形成連續的","pipeline. The first application we are pursuing in 2026 is":"流程。我們在 2026 年首先追求的應用是","early fungal-risk screening for high-value food and agricultural products during storage and incoming quality control":"在儲存與進料品質管制過程中，對高價值食品及農產品進行早期真菌風險篩檢","02 · Biological rationale":"02 · 生物學依據","Natural olfactory systems do not identify an odor using a single perfectly specific receptor. Instead, odors are represented by combinations of receptor activity, followed by neural transformations that make overlapping patterns easier to distinguish.":"天然嗅覺系統並不靠單一、完全專一的受體辨識氣味。氣味是由受體活動的組合表示，再經神經轉換，讓原本重疊的模式更容易區分。","In insects, odorant recognition involves a tuning":"在昆蟲中，氣味辨識涉及具氣味選擇性的","odorant receptor (OR)":"氣味受體（OR）","together with the conserved":"，以及保守的","odorant receptor co-receptor Orco":"氣味受體共受體 Orco",". Activation of the OR–Orco complex forms a cation-conducting sensory response (insect ORs are not GPCRs), converting chemical recognition into a cellular signal":"。OR–Orco 複合體活化後會形成可傳導陽離子的感測反應（昆蟲 OR 並非 GPCR），將化學辨識轉換為細胞訊號",". Construct-level mechanism and architecture:":"。構築層級的機制與架構：","Design · how AeroSense senses":"設計 · AeroSense 如何感測",", an Orco agonist, provides a useful experimental positive control for testing the functionality of this sensing pathway":"是一種 Orco 致效劑，可作為實驗陽性對照，用於測試這條感測路徑的功能","Published work gives this idea an experimental starting point. Zboray":"已發表的研究提供了實驗起點。Zboray","established stable HEK293 cell lines expressing seven":"建立了穩定 HEK293 細胞株，表現七種","odorant receptors, Orco, mCherry, and the genetically encoded calcium indicator GCaMP6. Their panel was characterized against 66":"氣味受體、Orco、mCherry，以及基因編碼的鈣離子指示蛋白 GCaMP6。其受體組合以 66 種","VOCs":"VOCs","and demonstrated that heterologously expressed insect olfactory receptors can generate measurable fluorescence responses to diverse volatile ligands":"進行特性分析，並證明異源表現的昆蟲嗅覺受體能對多種揮發性配體產生可量測的螢光反應","is a genetically encoded calcium indicator developed for sensitive fluorescence reporting of intracellular calcium dynamics":"是一種基因編碼的鈣離子指示蛋白，開發目的在於靈敏地以螢光呈現細胞內鈣離子動態","Chen et al., 2013 — full entry in References.":"Chen 等人，2013 年——完整書目見參考文獻。",". We use this optical signal as the interface between biological recognition and our electronic measurement layer.":"。我們以此光學訊號作為生物辨識與電子量測層之間的介面。","The proposed receptor-to-fluorescence mechanism is summarized in":"提議的受體到螢光機制概述於","Figure 2":"圖 2","From odorant to a measurable optical output.":"從氣味分子，到可量測的光學輸出。","Conceptual sensing chain: a volatile cue engages the OR–Orco receptor system, calcium entry changes GCaMP fluorescence, and an optical reader supplies a signal for pattern decoding. This schematic explains the proposed roles; it is not a measured end-to-end response.":"概念感測鏈：揮發性線索作用於 OR–Orco 受體系統，鈣離子流入改變 GCaMP 螢光，再由光學讀取器提供模式解碼所需的訊號。此示意圖解釋各部分的預定角色，並非實測的端到端反應。","Terms used in this section":"本節使用的詞彙","Short definitions are listed here so they are never only inside a tooltip. On desktop, dotted terms also open a glossary popover on hover or focus; on a phone, the same terms can be tapped, and this list remains visible.":"這裡列出簡短定義，避免資訊只藏在提示框內。桌機上，將滑鼠移至點線詞彙或以鍵盤聚焦，也能開啟詞彙說明；手機上可點按同一詞彙，而此清單會持續顯示。","Volatile organic compound — a carbon-containing chemical that readily enters the gas phase at ambient conditions.":"揮發性有機化合物：在環境條件下容易進入氣相的含碳化學物質。","Odorant / olfactory receptor — a receptor protein that binds odorant molecules and, with Orco, initiates an olfactory signal.":"氣味／嗅覺受體：結合氣味分子，並與 Orco 共同啟動嗅覺訊號的受體蛋白。","Odorant receptor co-receptor — the conserved insect co-receptor that partners with ORs to form a ligand-gated cation channel.":"氣味受體共受體：昆蟲中保守的共受體，與 OR 共同形成配體門控陽離子通道。","A genetically encoded fluorescent calcium indicator. GCaMP6 reports intracellular Ca²⁺ changes as fluorescence; it is not an AeroSense invention.":"基因編碼的螢光鈣離子指示蛋白。GCaMP6 以螢光反映細胞內 Ca²⁺ 變化；它不是 AeroSense 的發明。","A synthetic Orco-family agonist used as an experimental positive control for OR–Orco channel function — not an AeroSense invention.":"一種合成的 Orco 家族致效劑，用作 OR–Orco 通道功能的實驗陽性對照；不是 AeroSense 的發明。","Prior work matters":"既有研究很重要","Established prior work":"已建立的先前研究","Heterologous":"異源","OR/Orco + GCaMP-based sensing already has published precedent. Zboray":"OR／Orco 加上 GCaMP 的感測方式，已有發表文獻先例。Zboray","expressed insect ORs with Orco and GCaMP6 in HEK293 cells and recorded fluorescence responses to diverse VOCs":"在 HEK293 細胞中共同表現昆蟲 OR、Orco 與 GCaMP6，並記錄了對多種 VOCs 的螢光反應",". Jones":"。Jones","established VUAA1 as an Orco agonist for functional control of this pathway":"確認 VUAA1 可作為 Orco 致效劑，用於這條路徑的功能對照",". GCaMP6 itself is a published genetically encoded calcium indicator":"。GCaMP6 本身也是已發表的基因編碼鈣離子指示蛋白","The use of Drosophila OR/Orco and GCaMP in mammalian cells is not our invention.":"在哺乳類細胞中使用果蠅 OR／Orco 與 GCaMP，並不是我們的發明。","Our engineering question":"我們的工程問題","How can this biological sensing architecture be adapted, measured, decoded, calibrated and integrated into a reproducible bio-digital workflow?":"如何調整、量測、解碼、校正並整合此生物感測架構，形成可重現的生物數位工作流程？","AeroSense builds on that established architecture. It does not claim to have invented the receptor, the co-receptor, the calcium indicator, or the agonist control.":"AeroSense 建立在這個既有架構之上。我們並未宣稱發明受體、共受體、鈣離子指示蛋白或致效劑對照。","03 · System":"03 · 系統","Select a step to follow the measurement chain—from an odor cue to a screening decision.":"選擇一個步驟，沿著量測鏈，從氣味線索走向篩檢決策。","Former three-layer architecture figure":"原三層架構圖","Explore the measurement chain · conceptual overview":"探索量測鏈 · 概念概述","VOC → biological fluorescence":"VOC → 生物螢光","VOC → OR/Orco on HEK293 → Ca²⁺ → GCaMP fluorescence → optical output. Schematic, not a structure.":"VOC → HEK293 上的 OR／Orco → Ca²⁺ → GCaMP 螢光 → 光學輸出。這是示意圖，不是結構圖。","~470 nm LED → weak fluorescence → photodiode → LMP7721 TIA → ADS8866 ADC → ESP32 · FDM / digital lock-in. No measured SNR is shown.":"約 470 nm LED → 微弱螢光 → 光電二極體 → LMP7721 TIA → ADS8866 ADC → ESP32 · FDM／數位鎖相。此處未呈現實測訊雜比。","Conceptual transformation — computational inspiration, not a recorded panel":"概念轉換：運算上的靈感，不是實際記錄的受體面板資料","Overlapping responses":"重疊反應","Normalization":"正規化","AL-inspired contrast":"受觸角葉啟發的對比處理","MB-inspired sparse map":"受蘑菇體啟發的稀疏映射","Classifier / SNN-like out":"分類器／類 SNN 輸出","Check measurement quality":"檢查量測品質","Baseline · calibration · QC":"基準線 · 校正 · 品質管制","Interpret the pattern":"解讀模式","Response · confidence · context":"反應 · 信心程度 · 情境","Choose a follow-up":"選擇後續處理","Remeasure · monitor · confirm":"重新量測 · 監測 · 確認","Former biological sensing layer":"原生物感測層","03.1 · Sense":"03.1 · 感測","We express":"我們在 HEK293 細胞中表現","odorant receptors (ORs) with Orco in HEK293 cells, adapting a published heterologous olfactory-receptor strategy":"氣味受體（ORs）與 Orco，調整已發表的異源嗅覺受體策略",". Receptor activation drives a Ca²⁺ response, which GCaMP6f translates into green fluorescence. mCherry provides a separate expression reporter.":"。受體活化驅動 Ca²⁺ 反應，再由 GCaMP6f 轉換為綠色螢光。mCherry 則提供獨立的表現報導訊號。","Two questions guide the biology":"兩個問題引導生物實驗","Does the sensing chain respond to a positive control? Does the chosen receptor respond to the target VOC? We use VUAA1 as a functional positive-control stimulus before receptor-specific characterization.":"感測鏈是否會對陽性對照產生反應？所選受體是否會對目標 VOC 產生反應？在進行受體專一性分析之前，我們以 VUAA1 作為功能性陽性對照刺激。","Explore in depth":"深入探索","Former hardware layer":"原硬體層","03.2 · Read":"03.2 · 讀取","Approximately 470-nm modulated excitation illuminates the sensor. A photodiode converts weak fluorescence into current; an LMP7721 transimpedance amplifier and ADS8866 ADC prepare the signal for acquisition with an ESP32.":"約 470 nm 的調變激發光照射感測器。光電二極體將微弱螢光轉換成電流，再由 LMP7721 跨阻放大器與 ADS8866 ADC 處理訊號，供 ESP32 擷取。","Distinct modulation frequencies separate the optical channels. Digital lock-in detection recovers the corresponding periodic signals from background noise. Both principles build on published fluorescence and analytical-instrument methods":"不同的調變頻率用來區分光學通道。數位鎖相偵測則從背景雜訊中擷取對應的週期訊號。這兩項原理都建立在已發表的螢光與分析儀器方法上","Tovar et al., 2019 — full entry in References.":"Tovar 等人，2019 年——完整書目見參考文獻。","Harvie & de Mello, 2023 — full entry in References.":"Harvie 與 de Mello，2023 年——完整書目見參考文獻。","The engineering focus":"工程重點","Excitation leakage, ambient light, electronic noise and channel crosstalk must be controlled together.":"必須同時控制激發光洩漏、環境光、電子雜訊與通道串擾。","Former computational layer":"原運算層","03.3 · Decode":"03.3 · 解碼","A single receptor response is only part of the story. Fly olfaction provides inspiration for representing combinations of inputs as sparse activity patterns":"單一受體的反應只呈現部分資訊。果蠅嗅覺提供靈感，讓多個輸入的組合以稀疏活動模式表示","Caron et al., 2013 — full entry in References.":"Caron 等人，2013 年——完整書目見參考文獻。","Our pipeline normalizes the receptor response, enhances contrast with an antennal-lobe-inspired stage, and projects the result into a sparse representation inspired by mushroom-body coding. A classifier then interprets the pattern. The computational analogy builds on work connecting fly olfaction with similarity search":"我們的流程先將受體反應正規化，再以受觸角葉啟發的階段增強對比，接著投射至受蘑菇體編碼啟發的稀疏表徵，最後由分類器解讀模式。這種運算類比建立在連結果蠅嗅覺與相似性搜尋的研究上","What makes a useful decoder?":"什麼樣的解碼器才有用？","Compare with simpler baselines, then examine noise robustness, concentration shifts and the contribution of each processing stage.":"先與較簡單的基準方法比較，再檢視抗雜訊能力、濃度改變及各處理階段的貢獻。","03.4 · Act":"03.4 · 行動","The readout brings measurement quality and the decoded pattern together. Baseline, ΔF/F, calibration, quality flags and confidence give context to a screening signal.":"讀值將量測品質與解碼後的模式整合在一起。基準線、ΔF/F、校正、品質標記與信心程度，提供解讀篩檢訊號所需的背景。","A screening signal starts a follow-up":"篩檢訊號是後續調查的起點","Remeasure an uncertain sample, increase monitoring, isolate a suspect batch or request confirmatory testing. The appropriate response depends on the use case and the evidence.":"對不確定的樣品重新量測、加強監測、隔離可疑批次，或要求確認性檢測。適當處置取決於使用情境與證據。","The AeroSense measurement chain.":"AeroSense 量測鏈。","Exploratory biological context":"探索性的生物學背景","This fly recording motivates the biological approach. It does not validate the HEK293 receptor platform, the reader, or an integrated odor detector.":"這段果蠅記錄為生物學方法提供研究動機，並不能驗證 HEK293 受體平台、讀取器或整合式氣味偵測器。","We recorded the team-confirmed preparation":"我們記錄團隊確認的樣本","UAS-GCaMP6f":"UAS-GCaMP6f","with light-sheet microscopy during presentations of isopentyl acetate, 3-octanol and 4-methylcyclohexanol. The reporter is membrane-targeted mCD8::GFP, not a calcium indicator. The movie and regional traces document fluorescence; they do not establish odor-evoked calcium or neural activity.":"，以光片顯微鏡在乙酸異戊酯、3-辛醇及4-甲基環己醇呈現期間錄影。報導蛋白是膜定位的 mCD8::GFP，並非鈣離子指示劑。影片與區域曲線記錄的是螢光，不構成氣味誘發鈣離子變化或神經活動的證據。","Reading the anatomy":"閱讀解剖構造","One pathway carries an odor. Another can change its meaning.":"一條路徑傳遞氣味，另一條路徑則可能改變它的意義。","Trace the sensory pathway in the teaching diagram below, then compare it with reconstructed anatomy. A separate dopamine input can modulate the circuit.":"先沿著下方教學示意圖追蹤感覺路徑，再與重建的解剖構造比較。獨立的多巴胺輸入可以調節這個迴路。","Pathway details and biological references":"路徑細節與生物學文獻","In the adult fly, olfactory receptor neurons in the antennae and maxillary palps send input to glomeruli of the":"成蠅觸角與顎鬚中的嗅覺受體神經元，將輸入傳送至下列構造中的嗅小球：","antennal lobe":"觸角葉",". Projection neurons (PNs) then carry processed output toward higher brain regions, including the mushroom-body calyx and the lateral horn. In the mushroom body (MB), Kenyon cells (KCs) receive sensory input and connect to mushroom-body output neurons (MBONs). Dopaminergic inputs modulate this circuitry; they are not an obligatory extra step between PNs and KCs.":"。接著，投射神經元（PNs）將處理後的輸出送往更高階腦區，包括蘑菇體萼部與側角。在蘑菇體（MB）中，Kenyon 細胞（KCs）接收感覺輸入，並連接蘑菇體輸出神經元（MBONs）。多巴胺輸入會調節這套迴路，但不是 PNs 與 KCs 之間必經的額外步驟。","01 / Teaching schematic":"01／教學示意圖","Follow the pathway":"跟隨路徑","An odor is relayed; its meaning can be modulated.":"氣味被傳遞，而它的意義可以被調節。","Follow the solid pathway from sensory input to the antennal lobe, then the green projection neurons (PNs) toward the calyx and lateral horn. In the mushroom body (MB), Kenyon cells carry input toward MB output neurons. The dashed amber path shows a separate example of dopamine modulation. This original teaching schematic is unfolded and not to scale; it does not map our flies or their driver expression.":"沿著實線路徑，從感覺輸入走向觸角葉，再跟隨綠色投射神經元（PNs）前往萼部與側角。在蘑菇體（MB）中，Kenyon 細胞將輸入傳向蘑菇體輸出神經元。琥珀色虛線則示意另一條多巴胺調節路徑。這幅原創教學示意圖採展開配置，未依比例繪製，也未標示我們所用果蠅或其驅動子表現。","Original annotated teaching diagram":"原創註解教學圖","· The TH and GH146 preparation cards below explain the two marker strategies.":"· 下方的 TH 與 GH146 樣本卡片，說明這兩種標記策略。","Now locate those regions in real anatomy.":"接著，在真實解剖構造中找到這些區域。","The reference below shows reconstructed neurons at two scales. The short labels locate regions; the caption and key explain the colors.":"下方參考圖以兩種尺度呈現重建神經元。簡短標籤標示區域，圖說與圖例則解釋顏色。","Try the odor circuit →":"試試氣味迴路 →","Follow a signal, reveal a sparse pattern, then compare a scripted train/test example.":"跟隨訊號、觀察稀疏模式，再比較一個預先設定的訓練／測試範例。","02 / Published anatomy":"02／已發表的解剖資料","See the reconstructed neurons":"觀察重建神經元","Real reconstructed anatomy, rendered locally.":"真實的重建解剖資料，以本機繪製呈現。","A: whole-brain context. B: the same selected neurons at higher magnification.":"A：全腦背景。B：相同所選神經元的放大圖。",", antennal lobe;":"，觸角葉；","Calyx":"萼部",", mushroom-body input region;":"，蘑菇體的輸入區；",", lateral horn;":"，側角；",", mushroom-body lobes. Published MaleCNS v1.0 centerlines and neuropil surfaces provide the geometry; colors identify cell classes, not neural activity.":"，蘑菇體葉。幾何資料來自已發表的 MaleCNS v1.0 中心線與神經纖維網表面；顏色代表細胞類別，不代表神經活動。","This is a reference from another animal, not our TH/GH146 expression pattern or evidence of synapses between the selected cells.":"此參考資料來自另一隻動物，既不是我們的 TH／GH146 表現模式，也不是所選細胞之間存在突觸的證據。","Projection neurons · PN":"投射神經元 · PN","Dopaminergic neurons · PPL1":"多巴胺神經元 · PPL1","Mushroom-body output · MBON":"蘑菇體輸出 · MBON","Kenyon cells · KC":"Kenyon 細胞 · KC","Data: MaleCNS collaboration (FlyEM/HHMI Janelia, Cambridge, MRC LMB and Google Research),":"資料：MaleCNS 合作團隊（FlyEM／HHMI Janelia、Cambridge、MRC LMB 與 Google Research），",". Selection and rendering by AeroSense; source cell identities are listed below.":"。神經元選取與繪圖由 AeroSense 完成；來源細胞身分列於下方。","Full-resolution PNG":"完整解析度 PNG","Geometry and rendering code":"幾何資料與繪圖程式","What this adds to the TH and PN comparison.":"這些資料如何補充 TH 與 PN 的比較。","The green PN examples make the antennal-lobe-to-calyx and lateral-horn route visible in actual reconstructed geometry. The amber PPL1 examples illustrate a different role: dopaminergic input around mushroom-body circuitry, alongside Kenyon cells and MBONs. They do not identify the cells in our TH recording. Likewise, the four PNs are anatomical examples, not a measured GH146 expression set. The TH-GFP and GH146–GCaMP6f preparations are distinguished below.":"綠色 PN 範例以實際重建幾何呈現觸角葉通往蕈狀體萼部與外側角的路徑。琥珀色 PPL1 範例則呈現另一種角色：在蕈狀體迴路周圍，與 Kenyon 細胞及 MBON 並列的多巴胺輸入。它們不能識別我們 TH 影像中的細胞。同樣地，這四個 PN 是解剖範例，並非實測的 GH146 表現細胞群。以下分別說明 TH-GFP 與 GH146–GCaMP6f 樣本。","Read the two branches:":"閱讀兩條分支：","ORN → antennal lobe → PN → KC in the mushroom body → MBON; a separate PN branch reaches the lateral horn. The fly's first olfactory processing center is the antennal lobe. “Olfactory bulb” is the mammalian term and is not used for this fly structure.":"ORN → 觸角葉 → PN → 蘑菇體中的 KC → MBON；另一條 PN 分支通往側角。果蠅第一個嗅覺處理中樞是觸角葉。「嗅球」是哺乳類的用語，不用於這個果蠅構造。","5137;TH · TH-GFP imaging":"5137;TH · TH-GFP 影像","TH: looking at modulation":"TH：觀察調節","TH is tyrosine hydroxylase, an enzyme in dopamine synthesis. Published TH-GAL4 drivers target a subset of dopaminergic neurons, rather than every dopamine neuron or every neuron responding to an odor. Their expression is not identical to endogenous TH: a GAL4-positive cell is not, by itself, confirmed as dopaminergic. The actual preparation therefore matters.":"TH 是酪胺酸羥化酶，參與多巴胺合成。已發表的 TH-GAL4 驅動子會標記部分多巴胺神經元，而非所有多巴胺神經元或所有對氣味有反應的神經元。它們的表現並不完全等同於內源性 TH：僅憑 GAL4 陽性，不能確認細胞具有多巴胺性。因此，實際使用的樣本十分重要。","The team identifies the recorded preparation as":"團隊確認實際記錄的樣本為",". Its mCD8::GFP reporter labels membranes. Anatomical assignment, motion control and repeat measurements are needed to interpret regional fluorescence changes. The dated preparation record is in the":"。其 mCD8::GFP 報導蛋白用來標記膜。區域螢光變化的判讀仍需要解剖位置確認、運動控制與重複量測。附日期的製備紀錄見","GH146 × UAS-GCaMP6f · imaging pending":"GH146 × UAS-GCaMP6f · 尚待成像","GH146: looking at the relay":"GH146：觀察傳遞","GH146-GAL4 labels many antennal-lobe projection neurons, whose processes reveal routes toward the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn. It is not PN-exclusive: its expression also includes the anterior paired lateral (APL) neuron and other non-PN cells. A bright region therefore cannot be assigned to PNs solely from the driver name.":"GH146-GAL4 會標記許多觸角葉投射神經元，其突起可呈現通往蘑菇體萼部與側角的路徑。但它並非只標記 PN，也會表現在前側成對神經元（APL）及其他非 PN 細胞中。因此，不能只憑驅動子名稱，就將發亮區域認定為 PNs。","The separate GH146 preparation uses":"另一項 GH146 樣本使用",". Its preparation is recorded in the":"。其準備過程記錄於","PN imaging is pending.":"PN 成像尚待進行。","Any comparison with TH-GFP must account for the different reporters and requires a PN dataset with documented acquisition conditions.":"若要與 TH-GFP 比較，必須考量報導蛋白不同，並取得具有完整擷取條件紀錄的 PN 資料集。","Driver labels and reporter identity":"驅動品系標籤與報導蛋白身分","The team has clarified that this recording used":"團隊已澄清，本次影像使用","5137;TH (TH-GFP)":"5137;TH（TH-GFP）",". FlyBase lists BDSC 5137 as a UAS-mCD8::GFP reporter stock, consistent with this GFP label. The stock entry identifies the reporter, not the TH driver or the complete experimental cross. The exact parental cross and progeny genotype still need to be recorded. The separate GH146 preparation retains the team-confirmed UAS-GCaMP6f reporter.":"。FlyBase 將 BDSC 5137 列為 UAS-mCD8::GFP 報導品系，與此 GFP 標記一致。品系條目識別的是報導蛋白，並非 TH 驅動品系或完整實驗交配。確切親代交配與子代基因型仍需記錄。另一項 GH146 樣本維持團隊確認的 UAS-GCaMP6f 報導蛋白。","Here, ΔF/F₀ is normalized GFP fluorescence. mCD8::GFP is a membrane label, so these traces cannot be interpreted as a calcium readout. Motion, bleaching, baseline drift and stimulus-delivery artifacts require acquisition controls and repeat experiments.":"此處的 ΔF/F₀ 是正規化 GFP 螢光。mCD8::GFP 是膜標記，因此不能將這些曲線解讀為鈣離子讀值。運動、光漂白、基線漂移及刺激輸送假象，仍需透過擷取控制與重複實驗釐清。","Atlas sources, cell identities and the supplied viewer state":"圖譜來源、細胞身分與提供的檢視器狀態","The supplied Neuroglancer scene is titled":"提供的 Neuroglancer 場景標題為","MaleCNS v0.9":"MaleCNS v0.9",". Its display colors and selected segment IDs do not establish TH or GH146 identity. For the reconstruction above, we downloaded the official":"。其顯示顏色與選取的區段 ID，不能確立 TH 或 GH146 身分。為製作上方重建圖，我們下載了官方","MaleCNS v1.0":"MaleCNS v1.0","neuron annotations and centerline skeletons, plus brain-shell and neuropil surfaces from the same reference coordinate space. We did not load an external viewer into this page. The atlas loads as a 119 kB image; the geometry is available only in the optional download.":"神經元註解與中心線骨架，以及同一參考座標空間中的腦外殼與神經纖維網表面。我們沒有在此頁載入外部檢視器。圖譜以 119 kB 影像載入；幾何資料僅在選用下載中提供。","The source annotation identifies four PNs: DM1_lPN (10176) and VA1d_adPN (11355, 13725, 15313); two dopaminergic neurons: PPL101 (11327) and PPL103 (14182); and three output neurons: MBON11 (11402) and MBON12 (519368, 521086). The 15 KCg-m examples were selected by ascending body ID from right-side annotated cells, not by connectivity or driver expression. Their exact IDs are in the":"來源註解標示四個 PNs：DM1_lPN（10176）與 VA1d_adPN（11355、13725、15313）；兩個多巴胺神經元：PPL101（11327）與 PPL103（14182）；以及三個輸出神經元：MBON11（11402）與 MBON12（519368、521086）。15 個 KCg-m 範例，是從右側已註解細胞依 神經元 ID 遞增選出，而非依連結性或驅動子表現選取。完整 ID 見","selected-neuron record":"所選神經元記錄",". The anatomy explains the relevant cell classes but does not establish which cells our driver cross labels. No synthetic branches, tracer paths or synapses were added.":"。解剖資料說明相關細胞類別，但不能確定我們的驅動子雜交標記了哪些細胞。圖中未加入合成分支、追蹤路徑或突觸。","Dataset provenance, license and transformations":"資料集來源、授權與轉換","Mesh source and simplification record":"網格來源與簡化記錄","Original viewer-state summary":"原始檢視器狀態摘要",". The":"。上方的","teaching schematic above":"教學示意圖","explains the pathway separately from the reconstructed anatomy; both remain on this page.":"與重建解剖資料分別說明路徑；本頁保留兩者。","Play":"播放","Select Play to load the recording.":"按播放後載入影片。","Team light-sheet recording of 5137;TH (TH-GFP), a membrane-labeled preparation. Displayed at 6 frames/s and resized for web viewing.":"團隊的 5137;TH（TH-GFP）膜標記樣本光片影像。以每秒 6 格播放，並調整尺寸供網頁觀看。","Original AVI file":"原始 AVI 檔案","Exploratory normalized GFP fluorescence (ΔF/F₀) with local baselines. Regional variation does not establish a calcium response, a calibrated dose response or a replicated odor effect.":"採局部基線的探索性正規化 GFP 螢光（ΔF/F₀）。區域差異不構成鈣離子反應、經校正的劑量反應或具重複驗證之氣味效應的證據。","Regional mean GFP intensity (arbitrary units). Shaded intervals mark approximate odor presentation, not measured arrival at the tissue.":"區域平均 GFP 強度（任意單位）。陰影區間標示近似氣味呈現時間，並非組織位置的實測到達時間。","Interpretation.":"解讀。","The team confirms 5137;TH (TH-GFP) for this recording. The traces show GFP fluorescence, not a calcium-indicator response. Neuron assignment, stimulus timing at the specimen, motion correction and biological repeatability remain unresolved. Individual changes cannot be attributed to odor-evoked neural activity. This observation does not validate the engineered HEK293 sensor or hardware reader.":"團隊確認本次影像使用 5137;TH（TH-GFP）。曲線呈現 GFP 螢光，而非鈣離子指示劑反應。神經元身分、刺激到達樣本的時間、運動校正與生物可重複性仍未確認。不能將個別變化歸因於氣味誘發的神經活動。此觀察也不驗證工程化 HEK293 感測器或硬體讀取器。","Avishai and Parnas (2025)":"Avishai 與 Parnas（2025）","provides context for TH-associated neurons and odor-dependent dopaminergic modulation in the fly antennal lobe; that study used structural and two-photon functional imaging.":"提供果蠅觸角葉中 TH 相關神經元，以及氣味依賴性多巴胺調節的背景；該研究使用結構成像與雙光子功能成像。","04 · Contribution boundary":"04 · 貢獻範圍","Our central contribution is the integration and engineering of these ideas into one traceable measurement chain—not the reinvention of each individual component.":"我們的核心貢獻，是將這些構想整合並工程化為一條可追溯的量測鏈，而非重新發明每一個個別元件。","The left column is published literature. The right column is AeroSense-specific engineering. Established methods are not described as our inventions.":"左欄是已發表文獻，右欄是 AeroSense 特有的工程工作。既有方法不會被描述成我們的發明。","Comparison of established prior work, what that work established, and what AeroSense specifically adds":"比較先前研究、其已建立的成果，以及 AeroSense 具體增加的內容","Prior work":"先前研究","What it established":"已建立的成果","What AeroSense specifically adds":"AeroSense 具體增加的內容","Drosophila OR/Orco + GCaMP can function in HEK293 cellular sensing systems":"果蠅 OR／Orco 加上 GCaMP，可在 HEK293 細胞感測系統中運作","Adaptation to our constructs, receptor panel, HEK293 workflow and downstream instrument":"配合我們的構築、受體面板、HEK293 流程與下游儀器進行調整","Jones":"Jones","Orco activation and VUAA1 functional agonism":"Orco 活化與 VUAA1 的功能性致效作用","Positive-control logic for our sensing chain":"我們感測鏈的陽性對照邏輯","Sensitive genetically encoded calcium fluorescence":"靈敏的基因編碼鈣離子螢光","Optical interface between receptor activity and electronics":"受體活動與電子元件之間的光學介面","FDM fluorescence":"分頻多工螢光","Frequency-tagged excitation can be demultiplexed using one detection stream":"以頻率標記的激發光，可以從單一偵測資料流中解多工","Custom multi-channel biological fluorescence reader":"客製化多通道生物螢光讀取器","Digital lock-in systems":"數位鎖相系統","Synchronous detection can recover weak periodic optical signals":"同步偵測可擷取微弱的週期光學訊號","Embedded implementation with ESP32 acquisition and AeroSense calibration workflow":"結合 ESP32 資料擷取與 AeroSense 校正流程的嵌入式實作","Fly mushroom-body coding":"果蠅蘑菇體編碼","Sparse high-dimensional olfactory representations":"稀疏、高維度的嗅覺表徵","Decoder designed around our receptor-response dataset":"以我們的受體反應資料集為核心設計的解碼器","05 · Layers":"05 · 層次","A later claim needs evidence from the layers before it. These seven gates define what must be established.":"後一層的主張需要前面各層的證據支持。以下七道關卡列出必須確認的事項。","Construct":"構築","Did we build what we intended?":"我們是否建出了預定的構築？","Sequence verification, construct maps, expression.":"序列確認、構築圖譜與表現。","Functional sensing":"功能性感測","Does the biological transduction chain work?":"生物訊號轉導鏈是否運作？","VUAA1 positive control, negative controls, reproducible ΔF/F.":"VUAA1 陽性對照、陰性對照與可重現的 ΔF/F。","VOC characterization":"VOC 特性分析","Do receptors generate reproducible VOC-response patterns?":"受體是否產生可重現的 VOC 反應模式？","Receptor × VOC × concentration × time matrix.":"受體 × VOC × 濃度 × 時間矩陣。","Can the custom reader measure weak signals reliably?":"客製化讀取器能否可靠地量測微弱訊號？","Dark noise, linearity, SNR, leakage, crosstalk, calibration.":"暗雜訊、線性、訊雜比、光洩漏、串擾與校正。","Does the neuromorphic architecture add useful information?":"神經形態架構是否增加有用的資訊？","Baseline comparison, ablation, robustness, held-out performance.":"基準比較、消融分析、穩健性與保留測試集表現。","Integration":"整合","Does the complete data chain close?":"完整的資料鏈是否串接完成？","Microscope versus AeroSense comparison, end-to-end demonstration.":"顯微鏡與 AeroSense 的比較，以及端到端展示。","Food context":"食品情境","Does the signal arrive early enough to matter?":"訊號是否出現得夠早，足以發揮作用？","Controlled headspace test, time-to-detection, false positives and negatives, actionable threshold.":"受控頂空測試、檢出所需時間、偽陽性與偽陰性，以及可採取行動的門檻。","06 · Integration":"06 · 整合","External feedback changed which application we pursue first, and what the system is supposed to output.":"外部回饋改變了我們優先追求的應用，也改變了系統應該輸出的資訊。","Stakeholder / Feedback":"利害關係人／回饋","Early idea":"早期構想","AeroSense began as a broad biological VOC-sensing platform with possible applications across agriculture, food, environmental sensing and medicine.":"AeroSense 起初是一個廣泛的生物 VOC 感測平台，可能應用於農業、食品、環境感測與醫療。","External feedback challenged this framing.":"外部回饋挑戰了這種定位。","Insight":"洞見","A platform is not automatically a product":"平台不會自動成為產品","A technically versatile platform is not automatically a useful solution if the first user, decision, and value are unclear.":"如果第一位使用者、要支持的決策與價值都不清楚，技術上多功能的平台不會自動成為實用方案。","Design decision":"設計決策","2026 focus":"2026 年重點","We therefore narrowed the 2026 application to":"因此，我們將 2026 年的應用縮小為","early fungal-risk screening in high-value food and agricultural storage and incoming QC":"高價值食品與農產品儲存及進料品質管制中的早期真菌風險篩檢",", while retaining other VOC applications as future directions rather than current claims.":"，其他 VOC 應用則保留為未來方向，而非目前的成果宣稱。","Technical consequence":"技術上的影響","Output changed":"輸出改變了","Instead of stopping at “we detected a signal,” AeroSense is being designed around:":"AeroSense 的設計不只停留在「我們偵測到訊號」，而是圍繞著：","Biological change → VOC pattern → measurement → risk-oriented interpretation → follow-up action":"生物變化 → VOC 模式 → 量測 → 風險導向的解讀 → 後續行動","These decisions now influence our validation metrics, user interface, calibration strategy and future cartridge design.":"這些決策現在影響著我們的驗證指標、使用者介面、校正策略與未來匣體設計。","Integrated Human Practices — How stakeholder feedback changed AeroSense":"整合人文實踐：利害關係人的回饋如何改變 AeroSense","Former context and boundaries section":"原背景與範圍章節","07 · Boundaries":"07 · 範圍","Scientific credibility depends as much on defining boundaries as on presenting possibilities. The two columns below are a scope definition, not a warning list.":"科學可信度不只取決於呈現可能性，也取決於清楚界定範圍。下方兩欄定義的是專案範圍，而不是警告清單。","AeroSense is intended to be":"AeroSense 預期成為","an":"一個","early-warning and screening platform":"早期預警與篩檢平台","a way to study and measure engineered olfactory-receptor responses;":"研究及量測工程化嗅覺受體反應的方法；","a modular bio-digital architecture connecting synthetic biology, measurement and computation;":"連結合成生物學、量測與運算的模組化生物數位架構；","a system whose output can prioritize further inspection or confirmatory testing.":"可利用輸出資訊，安排後續檢查或確認性檢測優先順序的系統。","AeroSense is not currently claimed to be":"AeroSense 目前並未宣稱是","a direct mycotoxin assay;":"直接的真菌毒素檢測；","a replacement for microbiological culture, GC–MS, GC–IMS or validated regulatory testing;":"微生物培養、GC–MS、GC–IMS 或經驗證法規檢測的替代品；","a universal identifier for every VOC mixture;":"能辨識所有 VOC 混合物的通用工具；","a clinically or industrially validated diagnostic device;":"經臨床或產業驗證的診斷設備；","a demonstrated solution for every food, crop or disease.":"已證實適用於所有食品、作物或疾病的方案。","Future field implementations":"未來的場域實作","Future field-facing implementations must also physically contain the engineered cellular sensing element and prevent contact with food, users and the environment.":"未來面向實際場域的實作，也必須以物理方式封存工程化細胞感測元件，避免接觸食品、使用者與環境。","08 · Outlook":"08 · 展望","These are the steps that still follow from the architecture on this page.":"依照本頁架構，接下來仍需完成以下步驟。","Receptor assays":"受體試驗","Repeat P2 with matched vehicles, documented doses and gain, and replicate wells from independent cultures. Test reporter responsiveness, Orco dependence and OR-dependent VOC responses separately.":"以匹配的溶劑對照、完整記錄的劑量與增益，以及來自獨立培養的重複孔，再次進行 P2。分別檢驗報導蛋白反應性、Orco 依賴性與 OR 依賴的 VOC 反應。","Reader characterization":"讀取器特性分析","Bring up the current design fluorescence reader on calibrated light, then on cell fluorescence.":"先以經校正的光源啟用並測試目前設計的螢光讀取器，再測試細胞螢光。","Response dataset and decoder":"反應資料集與解碼器","Collect a receptor × VOC matrix and fit the AL/MB-inspired decoder to those patterns.":"收集受體 × VOC 矩陣，並以這些模式擬合受 AL／MB 啟發的解碼器。","Screening decision":"篩檢決策","Connect measurement-quality flags to a follow-up recommendation a quality-control user can act on.":"將量測品質標記連結至品質管制使用者可執行的後續建議。","Containment for field use":"場域使用的封存措施","Physically contain the engineered cells before any warehouse-facing implementation.":"在任何面向倉儲的實作之前，先以物理方式封存工程化細胞。","The Description page states the architecture and the claims we are and are not making. Layer detail lives on the pages below.":"「專案介紹」說明架構，以及我們提出與未提出的主張。各層細節請見下方頁面。","Constructs and system choices":"構築與系統選擇","Planned assays and controls":"規劃中的試驗與對照","Weak-fluorescence reader":"微弱螢光讀取器","Pattern decoding":"模式解碼","Design–build–test record":"設計—建構—測試記錄","How the application was narrowed":"應用範圍如何縮小","Measured outcomes only":"僅呈現實測結果","Low-poly stored-food scene with a fruit fly following an illustrative odor plume.":"低多邊形儲存食品場景，一隻果蠅跟隨示意的氣味羽流。","Faceted fruit-fly head and antennae introducing biological odor recognition.":"以有稜面的果蠅頭部與觸角，介紹生物氣味辨識。","Conceptual cell and receptor scene showing the calcium-linked sensing pathway.":"細胞與受體的概念場景，呈現與鈣離子相連的感測路徑。","Optical reader scene showing how fluorescence is collected by the hardware.":"光學讀取器場景，呈現硬體如何收集螢光。","Illustrative neural network showing how a distributed response becomes a sparse odor representation.":"神經網路示意圖，呈現分散反應如何轉為稀疏氣味表徵。","Conceptual response-pattern scene linking screening to a follow-up decision.":"反應模式的概念場景，將篩檢連結到後續決策。","Journey stages":"旅程階段","Autopilot":"自動駕駛","Flight joystick":"飛行搖桿","Choose a chapter of the AeroSense story":"選擇 AeroSense 故事的一個章節","Fruit-fly editorial print on an irregular sage brush field":"不規則鼠尾草綠筆刷底上的果蠅編輯插畫","Print illustration of a sensing cell with a fluorescence readout":"帶有螢光讀值的感測細胞版畫插圖","Cut-paper illustration of the AeroSense reader design":"AeroSense 讀取器設計的剪紙插圖","Print illustration of a shared notebook and agricultural observations":"共同筆記本與農業觀察的版畫插圖","A batch of stored food releases volatiles, an odor pattern prompts inspection, and a confirmatory test informs the decision.":"一批儲存食品釋出揮發物，氣味模式促使進行檢查，再由確認性檢測提供決策依據。","Odor recognition by OR and Orco, calcium entry, GCaMP6f fluorescence, optical readout and pattern decoding.":"OR 與 Orco 的氣味辨識、鈣離子流入、GCaMP6f 螢光、光學讀取及模式解碼。","Explore the AeroSense measurement chain":"探索 AeroSense 量測鏈","Pipeline stages":"流程階段","Screening follow-up":"篩檢後續處理","Open the teaching schematic at full size":"開啟完整尺寸的教學示意圖","Textbook-style fly olfactory pathway: sensory input enters the antennal lobe. Green projection-neuron paths branch to the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn. Kenyon cells relay through the mushroom-body lobes to output neurons; a separate dashed amber dopamine input modulates the circuit.":"教科書風格的果蠅嗅覺路徑：感覺輸入進入觸角葉。綠色投射神經元路徑分支通往蘑菇體萼部與側角。Kenyon 細胞經由蘑菇體葉將訊號傳遞至輸出神經元；另一條琥珀色虛線多巴胺輸入則調節此迴路。","Open the full-resolution MaleCNS brain reconstruction":"開啟完整解析度的 MaleCNS 腦部重建圖","Two views of actual MaleCNS electron-microscopy reconstructions: a whole-brain surface and a magnified view. Green projection neurons extend from the antennal lobe toward the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn; amber PPL1 dopaminergic neurons, purple mushroom-body output neurons, and gray Kenyon cells provide anatomical context. Region labels identify AL, calyx, lateral horn and mushroom-body lobes.":"兩個實際 MaleCNS 電子顯微鏡重建視圖：全腦表面與放大圖。綠色投射神經元從觸角葉延伸至蘑菇體萼部與側角；琥珀色 PPL1 多巴胺神經元、紫色蘑菇體輸出神經元，以及灰色 Kenyon 細胞提供解剖背景。區域標籤標示 AL、萼部、側角與蘑菇體葉。","Neuron color key":"神經元顏色圖例","Reference 17":"參考文獻 17","Reference 18":"參考文獻 18","Reference 19":"參考文獻 19","First frame of the team light-sheet recording":"團隊光片記錄的第一格影像","Play light-sheet recording":"播放光片紀錄","Light-sheet recording frame":"光片紀錄影格","Exploratory normalized GFP fluorescence traces with local baselines for five image regions around three odor presentations":"三次氣味呈現前後，五個影像區域採局部基線的探索性正規化 GFP 螢光曲線","Mean GFP fluorescence over time in center, up, down, left and right regions, with three approximate odor presentation windows":"中央、上、下、左、右區域的平均 GFP 螢光時間曲線，標示三個近似氣味呈現時窗","Reference 20":"參考文獻 20","Prior work versus AeroSense engineering":"先前研究與 AeroSense 工程工作比較","Human Practices design-evolution chain":"人文實踐設計演進鏈","Description · AeroSense · NTHU iGEM 2026":"專案介紹 · AeroSense · NTHU iGEM 2026","SOURCE IN SIGHT":"發現來源","01 / AIR":"01／空氣","INTERACTIVE SCORE":"互動分數","MANUAL FLIGHT":"手動飛行","READY":"就緒","DRAG TO FLY":"拖曳來飛行","FOLLOW THE SCENT.":"循著氣味前進。","AIR":"空氣","FLY":"果蠅","CELL":"細胞","READ":"讀取","DECODE":"解碼","ACT":"行動","02 / FLY":"02／果蠅","02 / OLFACTION":"02／嗅覺","03 / CELL":"03／細胞","03 / SENSE":"03／感測","04 / READ":"04／讀取","05 / DECODE":"05／解碼","06 / ACT":"06／行動","AT THE RECEPTOR.":"抵達受體。","WE BORROWED THE RECEPTOR.":"我們借用了這個受體。","A GLOW BECOMES A SIGNAL.":"微光成為訊號。","SEPARATE WHAT OVERLAPS.":"分辨重疊的模式。","FROM SIGNAL TO A REASON TO LOOK CLOSER.":"從訊號找到進一步探查的理由。","The fly pauses as the view follows an odor cue toward its antenna. This is an illustrative perspective shift, not a molecule-level simulation.":"果蠅停下，視角循著氣味線索移向觸角。這是示意性的視角轉換，並非分子層級模擬。","The story now moves to a separate engineered HEK293 cell carrying the proposed OR–Orco/GCaMP sensing architecture.":"故事現在轉向另一個工程化 HEK293 細胞，其中承載所提出的 OR–Orco／GCaMP 感測架構。","The reader is designed to turn weak fluorescence into a digitized measurement.":"讀取器的設計目標，是將微弱螢光轉為數位量測值。","Fly-inspired decoding compares response patterns. This flight illustrates the design, not measured performance.":"受果蠅啟發的解碼方法比較反應模式。此飛行體驗示意設計概念，並非實測效能。","Early screening can help prioritize what deserves inspection or confirmation.":"早期篩檢可協助決定哪些樣本應優先檢查或確認。","LIGHT → PHOTODIODE → TIA → ADC":"光 → 光電二極體 → TIA → ADC","INPUT → CONTRAST → SPARSE CODE":"輸入 → 對比增強 → 稀疏編碼","The odor source":"氣味來源","The fly antenna":"果蠅觸角","The engineered cell":"工程化細胞","The optical reader":"光學讀取器","The pattern decoder":"模式解碼器","You reached the food headspace. The fly can follow a changing odor plume before a change is visible.":"你已抵達食品上方的氣相空間。果蠅可在變化肉眼可見之前，循著改變的氣味流前進。","The fly stays here. Continue as an odor cue approaching the receptor; the next scene is an engineered cell, not the fly’s body.":"果蠅留在這裡。接著以氣味線索的視角靠近受體；下一個場景是工程化細胞，並非果蠅體內。","OR and Orco form the proposed recognition path. GCaMP6f is the intended green Ca²⁺ reporter; functional validation is a separate question.":"OR 與 Orco 構成所提出的辨識路徑。GCaMP6f 是預定使用的綠色 Ca²⁺ 報導蛋白；是否具有功能仍須另外驗證。","Fluorescence must pass through the photodiode and electronics before it becomes a digital measurement.":"螢光須經光電二極體與電子電路，才能轉為數位量測值。","A distributed response can inform screening, with follow-up testing needed before any safety decision.":"分散式反應可提供篩檢依據；做出任何安全判定前，仍須後續檢測。","Signal waypoint reached":"已抵達訊號航點","Continue the journey →":"繼續旅程 →","Follow one odor molecule →":"跟隨一個氣味分子 →","Enter the antenna →":"進入觸角 →","Journey waypoint progress":"旅程航點進度","FOLLOW THE LUMINOUS TRAIL · NEXT: ODOR SOURCE":"跟隨發光路徑 · 下一站：氣味來源","RETURN TO THE BIG PICTURE":"回到整體視角","PERSPECTIVE SHIFT · FOLLOW ONE ODOR MOLECULE":"轉換視角 · 跟隨一個氣味分子","ENTERING THE ANTENNA · NEXT: ENGINEERED CELL":"進入觸角 · 下一站：工程化細胞","The fly pauses. The camera turns to follow an odor molecule. Movement resumes after the transition.":"果蠅暫停，鏡頭轉而跟隨氣味分子。轉場後恢復移動。","Follow the molecule toward the antenna. The next scene connects this idea to the engineered cell.":"跟隨分子靠近觸角。下一個場景將此概念連結到工程化細胞。","JOURNEY COMPLETE · YOUR SCORE IS SAVED":"旅程完成 · 分數已儲存","YOU ARE THE FLY · FOLLOW THE ODOR":"你是果蠅 · 跟隨氣味","FOLLOW THE ODOR · MOLECULAR VIEW":"跟隨氣味 · 分子視角","FOLLOW THE SIGNAL · SENSOR TO DECISION":"跟隨訊號 · 從感測器到決策","Autopilot on":"自動駕駛開啟","AUTOPILOT":"自動駕駛","COMPLETE":"已完成","PAUSED":"已暫停","STORY":"故事","READING":"閱讀中","WAITING":"等待中","MOVING":"移動中","Preparing the complete journey…":"正在準備完整旅程…","Preparing light and materials…":"正在準備光線與材質…","Resume":"繼續","Glowing waypoint ahead. Fly through its green ring to unlock the next scene.":"前方有發光航點。飛越綠色圓環以解鎖下一個場景。","WAYPOINT AHEAD · FLY THROUGH THE GREEN RING":"前方航點 · 飛越綠色圓環","Perspective change complete. Autopilot is continuing to the next glowing waypoint.":"視角轉換完成。自動駕駛正前往下一個發光航點。","Perspective change complete. Use forward, back and steering to reach the next glowing waypoint.":"視角轉換完成。使用前進、後退與轉向抵達下一個發光航點。","SIGNAL >":"訊號 >","< SIGNAL":"< 訊號","Odor source reached. Follow one molecule toward an olfactory receptor.":"已抵達氣味來源。跟隨一個分子前往嗅覺受體。","Receptor encountered. OR and Orco work together in an odor-gated ion channel.":"已接近受體。OR 與 Orco 共同形成由氣味啟動的離子通道。","Reporter reached. A calcium change can become a fluorescence change.":"已抵達報導蛋白。鈣離子變化可轉為螢光變化。","Reader reached. Optical detection turns light into an electrical signal.":"已抵達讀取器。光學偵測將光轉為電訊號。","Pattern stage reached. The model interprets a distributed response.":"已抵達模式階段。模型解讀分散式反應。","Follow-up point reached. A screening signal calls for confirmatory testing.":"已抵達後續檢查點。篩檢訊號提示需要確認性檢測。","Interactive 3D view failed to start. Serve this folder over http and refresh.":"互動式 3D 檢視無法啟動。請透過 http 提供此資料夾，再重新整理。","3D flight did not load. Serve this folder over http (not file://) and refresh.":"3D 飛行未載入。請透過 http（而非 file://）提供此資料夾，再重新整理。","+100 SOURCE":"+100 來源","+150 SOURCE":"+150 來源","+100 CHECKPOINT":"+100 檢查點","Autopilot off. You control the flight.":"自動駕駛已關閉，由你控制飛行。","Autopilot on. The tour follows the signal and continues each story after eight seconds. Use movement controls or turn Autopilot off to take over.":"自動駕駛已開啟。導覽將循著訊號前進，每段故事停留八秒後繼續。使用移動控制，或關閉自動駕駛，即可接手。","Follow the signal. Drag the joystick up to fly forward, down to go back, and left or right to steer. Release to stop, or enable Autopilot for a guided tour.":"跟隨訊號。將搖桿往上拖曳以向前飛行，往下拖曳以後退，左右拖曳以轉向。放開即停止；也可開啟自動駕駛進行導覽。","Follow the signal. Hold W or Up to fly forward, S or Down to go back, A and D or Left and Right to steer. Enable Autopilot for a guided tour.":"跟隨訊號。按住 W 或上方向鍵向前飛行，S 或下方向鍵後退，A、D 或左右方向鍵轉向。也可開啟自動駕駛進行導覽。","FOLLOW THE SCENT. A stored batch can change before the warning becomes visible.":"循著氣味前進。 儲存中的批次可能在警訊變得可見之前，就已發生變化。","AT THE RECEPTOR. The fly pauses as the view follows an odor cue toward its antenna. This is an illustrative perspective shift, not a molecule-level simulation.":"抵達受體。 果蠅停下，視角循著氣味線索移向觸角。這是示意性的視角轉換，並非分子層級模擬。","WE BORROWED THE RECEPTOR. The story now moves to a separate engineered HEK293 cell carrying the proposed OR–Orco/GCaMP sensing architecture.":"我們借用了這個受體。 故事現在轉向另一個工程化 HEK293 細胞，其中承載所提出的 OR–Orco／GCaMP 感測架構。","A GLOW BECOMES A SIGNAL. The reader is designed to turn weak fluorescence into a digitized measurement.":"微光成為訊號。 讀取器的設計目標，是將微弱螢光轉為數位量測值。","SEPARATE WHAT OVERLAPS. Fly-inspired decoding compares response patterns. This flight illustrates the design, not measured performance.":"分辨重疊的模式。 受果蠅啟發的解碼方法比較反應模式。此飛行體驗示意設計概念，並非實測效能。","FROM SIGNAL TO A REASON TO LOOK CLOSER. Early screening can help prioritize what deserves inspection or confirmation.":"從訊號找到進一步探查的理由。 早期篩檢可協助決定哪些樣本應優先檢查或確認。","THE ODOR SOURCE":"氣味來源","NEXT SIGNAL · THE ODOR SOURCE":"下一個訊號 · 氣味來源","SIGNAL FOUND · THE ODOR SOURCE":"發現訊號 · 氣味來源","AUTOPILOT · NEXT: THE ODOR SOURCE":"自動駕駛 · 下一站：氣味來源","YOUR MOVE · NEXT: THE ODOR SOURCE":"由你控制 · 下一站：氣味來源","THE FLY ANTENNA":"果蠅觸角","NEXT SIGNAL · THE FLY ANTENNA":"下一個訊號 · 果蠅觸角","SIGNAL FOUND · THE FLY ANTENNA":"發現訊號 · 果蠅觸角","AUTOPILOT · NEXT: THE FLY ANTENNA":"自動駕駛 · 下一站：果蠅觸角","YOUR MOVE · NEXT: THE FLY ANTENNA":"由你控制 · 下一站：果蠅觸角","THE ENGINEERED CELL":"工程化細胞","NEXT SIGNAL · THE ENGINEERED CELL":"下一個訊號 · 工程化細胞","SIGNAL FOUND · THE ENGINEERED CELL":"發現訊號 · 工程化細胞","AUTOPILOT · NEXT: THE ENGINEERED CELL":"自動駕駛 · 下一站：工程化細胞","YOUR MOVE · NEXT: THE ENGINEERED CELL":"由你控制 · 下一站：工程化細胞","THE OPTICAL READER":"光學讀取器","NEXT SIGNAL · THE OPTICAL READER":"下一個訊號 · 光學讀取器","SIGNAL FOUND · THE OPTICAL READER":"發現訊號 · 光學讀取器","AUTOPILOT · NEXT: THE OPTICAL READER":"自動駕駛 · 下一站：光學讀取器","YOUR MOVE · NEXT: THE OPTICAL READER":"由你控制 · 下一站：光學讀取器","THE PATTERN DECODER":"模式解碼器","NEXT SIGNAL · THE PATTERN DECODER":"下一個訊號 · 模式解碼器","SIGNAL FOUND · THE PATTERN DECODER":"發現訊號 · 模式解碼器","AUTOPILOT · NEXT: THE PATTERN DECODER":"自動駕駛 · 下一站：模式解碼器","YOUR MOVE · NEXT: THE PATTERN DECODER":"由你控制 · 下一站：模式解碼器","AT THE":"抵達","RECEPTOR.":"受體。","WE BORROWED":"我們借用了","THE RECEPTOR.":"這個受體。","A GLOW BECOMES":"微光成為","A SIGNAL.":"訊號。","SEPARATE":"分辨","WHAT OVERLAPS.":"重疊的模式。","FROM SIGNAL":"從訊號","TO A REASON":"找到進一步","TO LOOK CLOSER.":"探查的理由。","Proposed sensing and measurement chain":"規劃中的感測與量測鏈","Odor sensing at the HEK293 cell membrane":"HEK293 細胞膜上的氣味感測","An odorant engages OR in the OR–Orco channel at the cell membrane. Calcium enters the cytoplasm and changes GCaMP fluorescence. The shapes show functional roles, not molecular structure or stoichiometry.":"氣味分子作用於細胞膜 OR–Orco 通道中的 OR。鈣離子進入細胞質，改變 GCaMP 螢光。圖形表示各元件的功能，不代表分子結構或化學計量比。","Outside the cell":"細胞外","HEK293 cytoplasm":"HEK293 細胞質","Cell membrane":"細胞膜","Green":"綠色","fluorescence":"螢光","Biological sensing":"生物感測","Optical readout":"光學讀取","Fluorescence → digital signal":"螢光 → 數位訊號","Response pattern → screening cue":"反應模式 → 篩檢線索","Proposed optical reader signal path":"規劃中的光學讀取訊號路徑","470 nm LED":"470 nm LED","Modulated excitation":"調變激發光","Cell fluorescence":"細胞螢光","Optical response":"光學反應","Photodiode":"光電二極體","Light → current":"光 → 電流","LMP7721 TIA":"LMP7721 跨阻放大器","Current → voltage":"電流 → 電壓","ADS8866 ADC":"ADS8866 類比數位轉換器","Voltage → samples":"電壓 → 取樣資料","Digital lock-in recovery":"數位鎖相訊號擷取","Modulation reference → synchronized digital recovery":"調變參考訊號 → 同步數位訊號擷取","Earlier signals of spoilage":"腐敗前的早期訊號","Why use odor receptors?":"為什麼使用氣味受體？","From odor to follow-up":"從氣味到後續查驗","Turn odor binding into fluorescence":"將氣味結合轉為螢光","Recover weak fluorescence":"讀取微弱螢光","Decode receptor patterns":"解碼受體反應模式","Guide the next check":"引導下一步查驗","See neurons signal with light":"看見神經訊號發出的光","What we borrow and build":"我們借鑑什麼、建立什麼","Each claim depends on the last":"每層主張都需要前層證據","What stakeholders changed":"利害關係人帶來的改變","Screening prompts confirmation":"篩檢引導確認檢驗","Next validation steps":"下一步驗證","See fluorescently labeled neurons":"看見螢光標記的神經元","The TH-GFP and GH146–GCaMP6f preparations are distinguished below.":"以下分別說明 TH-GFP 與 GH146–GCaMP6f 樣本。","Team light-sheet recording of 5137;TH GFP fluorescence, with seek and play controls below":"團隊的 5137;TH GFP 螢光光片影像，下方提供進度與播放控制","Reporter stock identity; the team identifies the preparation as 5137;TH (TH-GFP). The full cross remains to be documented; checked 13 October 2026.":"報導品系身分；團隊確認樣本為 5137;TH（TH-GFP）。完整交配仍待記錄；2026 年 10 月 13 日查核。","BDSC 5137 is a UAS-mCD8::GFP reporter stock, consistent with the team's 5137;TH / TH-GFP label. The entry does not establish the complete driver cross.":"BDSC 5137 是 UAS-mCD8::GFP 報導品系，與團隊的 5137;TH／TH-GFP 標籤一致。此條目不確立完整的驅動品系交配。","In the single-plate P2 pilot, an ORCO-only well showed an 11.86% VUAA1-associated excursion, while a buffer-only Or35a + ORCO well rose 35.25%. The unmatched DMSO vehicle, unknown VOC doses, gain uncertainty and one well per condition prevent a receptor-specific conclusion.":"在只有一盤的 P2 先導試驗中，ORCO-only 孔出現 11.86% 的 VUAA1 相關變化，而僅加入緩衝液的 Or35a + ORCO 孔上升 35.25%。未匹配的 DMSO 溶劑對照、未知的 VOC 劑量、增益不確定性，以及每條件僅一孔，使這些結果尚不足以支持受體專一性結論。","Inspect the P2 evidence and controls":"檢視 P2 證據與對照","P2: time courses acquired; receptor specificity remains unresolved.":"P2：已取得時間曲線，受體專一性仍未確立。","We recorded fluorescently labeled neurons with light-sheet microscopy during odor presentation.":"我們在呈現氣味時，使用光片顯微鏡記錄螢光標記神經元。","The preparation was":"實驗使用的製備為",", with membrane-targeted mCD8::GFP. We presented isopentyl acetate, 3-octanol and 4-methylcyclohexanol; the movie and regional traces record GFP fluorescence.":"，採用膜定位的 mCD8::GFP。我們呈現 isopentyl acetate、3-octanol 及 4-methylcyclohexanol；影片與區域軌跡記錄的是 GFP 螢光。","TH-GFP imaging":"TH-GFP 成像","This membrane label provides anatomical context. Regional fluorescence changes require cell assignment, motion control and repeat measurements. The dated preparation record is in the":"這種膜標記提供解剖背景。判讀區域螢光變化需要細胞身分判定、位移控制與重複量測。附日期的製備紀錄見","FlyBase lists BDSC 5137 as a UAS-mCD8::GFP reporter stock, consistent with the recorded membrane label.":"FlyBase 將 BDSC 5137 列為 UAS-mCD8::GFP 報導品系，與本次記錄的膜標記一致。","Team TH-GFP light-sheet recording. Displayed at 6 frames/s and resized for web viewing.":"團隊的 TH-GFP 光片顯微錄影。以每秒 6 幀播放，並縮放供網頁觀看。","Team TH-GFP light-sheet recording, with seek and play controls below":"團隊的 TH-GFP 光片錄影，下方提供定位與播放控制","The traces describe GFP fluorescence, not calcium activity. Neuron identity, stimulus arrival, motion correction and biological repeatability remain to be validated.":"這些軌跡描述 GFP 螢光，而非鈣活動。神經元身分、氣味到達時間、位移校正與生物重複性仍待驗證。","provides context for TH-associated neurons through structural and two-photon functional imaging.":"透過結構與雙光子功能成像，提供 TH 相關神經元的研究背景。","This recording does not establish odor-evoked neural activity or validate the HEK293 sensing platform, reader or integrated odor detector.":"這段錄影無法確立氣味誘發的神經活動，也不驗證 HEK293 感測平台、讀取器或整合式氣味偵測器。","Two complementary circuit roles. The green PN examples show the route from the antennal lobe to the calyx and lateral horn. Amber PPL1 examples show dopaminergic input around mushroom-body circuitry, alongside Kenyon cells and MBONs. These reference reconstructions provide anatomical context for the driver labels below.":"兩種互補的神經迴路角色。綠色 PN 範例顯示從觸角葉通往蕈狀體萼與側角的路徑；琥珀色 PPL1 範例則顯示蕈狀體迴路周圍的多巴胺輸入，並呈現 Kenyon 細胞與 MBON。這些參考重建為下方的驅動子標籤提供解剖背景。","TH is tyrosine hydroxylase, an enzyme in dopamine synthesis. Published TH-GAL4 drivers label subsets of dopaminergic neurons, with expression patterns that depend on the driver line. [16] [17]":"TH 是參與多巴胺合成的酪胺酸羥化酶。已發表的 TH-GAL4 驅動子會標記部分多巴胺神經元，表現範圍依驅動子品系而異。 [16] [17]","The TH-GFP membrane label makes neuronal structures visible. The preparation and imaging methods accompany the dated Notebook record .":"TH-GFP 膜標記使神經元結構可見。製備與成像方法可與附日期的 Notebook 紀錄對照。","The TH-GFP membrane label makes neuronal structures visible. The preparation and imaging methods accompany the dated Notebook record.":"TH-GFP 膜標記使神經元結構可見。製備與成像方法可與附日期的 Notebook 紀錄對照。","GH146-GAL4 labels many antennal-lobe projection neurons, revealing routes toward the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn. Its expression also includes the anterior paired lateral (APL) neuron and other non-PN cells. [12] [18]":"GH146-GAL4 會標記許多觸角葉投射神經元，呈現通往蕈狀體萼與側角的路徑。其表現範圍也包含前成對側向（APL）神經元及其他非 PN 細胞。 [12] [18]","The separate GH146 preparation used UAS-GCaMP6f ; its preparation is recorded in the Notebook .":"另一組 GH146 製備使用 UAS-GCaMP6f；製備紀錄收錄於 Notebook。","The separate GH146 preparation used UAS-GCaMP6f; its preparation is recorded in the Notebook.":"另一組 GH146 製備使用 UAS-GCaMP6f；製備紀錄收錄於 Notebook。","GH146 × UAS-GCaMP6f · preparation record":"GH146 × UAS-GCaMP6f・製備紀錄","FlyBase identifies BDSC 5137 as UAS-mCD8::GFP , consistent with the team’s 5137;TH (TH-GFP) neuronal membrane label. [19]":"FlyBase 將 BDSC 5137 列為 UAS-mCD8::GFP，與團隊使用的 5137;TH（TH-GFP）神經元膜標記相符。 [19]","FlyBase identifies BDSC 5137 as UAS-mCD8::GFP, consistent with the team’s 5137;TH (TH-GFP) neuronal membrane label. [19]":"FlyBase 將 BDSC 5137 列為 UAS-mCD8::GFP，與團隊使用的 5137;TH（TH-GFP）神經元膜標記相符。 [19]","The plots summarize regional GFP intensity and local-baseline ΔF/F₀. See the image-analysis methods for normalization and interpretation.":"圖中彙整各區域的 GFP 強度及以局部基線計算的 ΔF/F₀。正規化與判讀方式見影像分析方法。","Figure 6. Regional GFP fluorescence normalized to local baselines (ΔF/F₀), around three odor presentations. Analysis methods.":"圖 6. 三次氣味呈現前後，各區域 GFP 螢光相對局部基線的正規化變化（ΔF/F₀）。分析方法。","Figure 6. Regional GFP fluorescence normalized to local baselines (ΔF/F₀), around three odor presentations. Analysis methods .":"圖 6. 三次氣味呈現前後，各區域 GFP 螢光相對局部基線的正規化變化（ΔF/F₀）。分析方法。","Biological context. Avishai and Parnas (2025) studied TH-associated neurons using structural and two-photon imaging. Our light-sheet record adds a view of neuronal membrane labeling during odor presentation; its methods and analytical limits are documented in Experiments .":"生物學背景。Avishai 與 Parnas（2025）以結構與雙光子成像研究 TH 相關神經元。我們的光片紀錄呈現氣味呈現期間的神經元膜標記；方法與分析限制收錄於 Experiments。 Avishai and Parnas (2025)","Biological context. Avishai and Parnas (2025) studied TH-associated neurons using structural and two-photon imaging. Our light-sheet record adds a view of neuronal membrane labeling during odor presentation; its methods and analytical limits are documented in Experiments.":"生物學背景。Avishai 與 Parnas（2025）以結構與雙光子成像研究 TH 相關神經元。我們的光片紀錄呈現氣味呈現期間的神經元膜標記；方法與分析限制收錄於 Experiments。 Avishai and Parnas (2025)","We narrowed the 2026 application to early fungal-risk screening in high-value food and agricultural storage and incoming QC .":"我們將 2026 年應用聚焦於高價值食品與農產品的儲存及進料品管，進行早期真菌風險篩檢。","We narrowed the 2026 application to early fungal-risk screening in high-value food and agricultural storage and incoming QC.":"我們將 2026 年應用聚焦於高價值食品與農產品的儲存及進料品管，進行早期真菌風險篩檢。","These decisions shaped our validation metrics, user interface and calibration strategy.":"這些決策塑造了我們的驗證指標、使用者介面與校正策略。","Cell containment The engineered cellular sensing element requires physical containment at the sample interface.":"細胞隔離。工程化細胞感測元件須在樣本介面中維持物理隔離。","Experimental methods and controls":"實驗方法與控制組","Turning light into a measurement.":"將光轉成量測。","Two complementary circuit roles.":"兩種互補的神經迴路角色。","The green PN examples show the route from the antennal lobe to the calyx and lateral horn. Amber PPL1 examples show dopaminergic input around mushroom-body circuitry, alongside Kenyon cells and MBONs. These reference reconstructions provide anatomical context for the driver labels below.":"綠色 PN 範例顯示從觸角葉通往蕈狀體萼與側角的路徑。琥珀色 PPL1 範例顯示蕈狀體迴路周圍的多巴胺輸入，並呈現 Kenyon 細胞與 MBON。這些參考重建為下方驅動子標籤提供解剖背景。","TH is tyrosine hydroxylase, an enzyme in dopamine synthesis. Published TH-GAL4 drivers label subsets of dopaminergic neurons, with expression patterns that depend on the driver line.":"TH 是參與多巴胺合成的酪胺酸羥化酶。已發表的 TH-GAL4 驅動子標記部分多巴胺神經元，表現範圍依驅動子品系而異。","The TH-GFP membrane label makes neuronal structures visible. The":"TH-GFP 膜標記使神經元結構可見。","preparation and imaging methods":"製備與成像方法","accompany the dated":"可與附日期的","Notebook record":"Notebook 紀錄對照","GH146-GAL4 labels many antennal-lobe projection neurons, revealing routes toward the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn. Its expression also includes the anterior paired lateral (APL) neuron and other non-PN cells.":"GH146-GAL4 會標記許多觸角葉投射神經元，呈現通往蕈狀體萼與側角的路徑。其表現範圍也包含前成對側向（APL）神經元及其他非 PN 細胞。","The separate GH146 preparation used":"另一組 GH146 製備使用","; its preparation is recorded in the":"；其製備紀錄收錄於","FlyBase identifies BDSC 5137 as":"FlyBase 將 BDSC 5137 列為","UAS-mCD8::GFP":"UAS-mCD8::GFP",", consistent with the team’s":"，與團隊的","neuronal membrane label.":"神經元膜標記相符。","The plots summarize regional GFP intensity and local-baseline ΔF/F₀. See the":"圖中彙整各區域 GFP 強度與局部基線 ΔF/F₀。請參閱","image-analysis methods":"影像分析方法","for normalization and interpretation.":"了解正規化與判讀方式。","Regional GFP fluorescence normalized to local baselines (ΔF/F₀), around three odor presentations.":"三次氣味呈現前後，各區域 GFP 螢光相對局部基線的正規化變化（ΔF/F₀）。","Analysis methods":"分析方法","Biological context.":"生物學背景。","studied TH-associated neurons using structural and two-photon imaging. Our light-sheet record adds a view of neuronal membrane labeling during odor presentation; its methods and analytical limits are documented in":"以結構與雙光子成像研究 TH 相關神經元。我們的光片紀錄呈現氣味呈現期間的神經元膜標記；方法與分析限制收錄於","We narrowed the 2026 application to":"我們將 2026 年應用聚焦於","Cell containment":"細胞隔離","The engineered cellular sensing element requires physical containment at the sample interface.":"工程化細胞感測元件須在樣本介面中維持物理隔離。","Biological context":"生物學脈絡","From odor to neural signals":"從氣味到神經訊號","Fly olfactory circuits transform sensory input into neural patterns. We used light-sheet microscopy to observe TH-GFP labeled structures and GH146-GCaMP6f fluorescence during odor presentation.":"果蠅嗅覺迴路將感官輸入轉成神經訊號模式。我們使用光片顯微鏡，觀察給味期間的 TH-GFP 標記構造與 GH146-GCaMP6f 螢光。","Olfactory circuitry":"嗅覺迴路","Projection neurons relay olfactory input; dopaminergic neurons modulate selected circuits.":"投射神經元傳遞嗅覺輸入；多巴胺神經元則調節特定迴路。","Projection neurons (PNs) carry antennal-lobe output toward the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn. Kenyon cells relay through the mushroom body to output neurons; the dashed path shows a separate dopamine input. This unfolded teaching schematic describes circuit roles.":"投射神經元（PN）將觸角葉輸出傳往蕈狀體萼與側角。Kenyon 細胞經蕈狀體傳遞至輸出神經元；虛線表示另一條多巴胺輸入。這張展開的教學示意圖說明各迴路的角色。","Published reconstructions locate these cell classes in reference anatomy.":"已發表的重建資料，提供這些細胞類型在腦中的解剖位置參考。","TH-GFP: labeled structures":"TH-GFP：標記神經構造","The membrane-targeted GFP label reveals neuronal structures in our left-side recording.":"膜定位 GFP 標記呈現了左側拍攝視野中的神經構造。","View TH-GFP imaging →":"查看 TH-GFP 影像 →","GH146: fluorescence dynamics":"GH146：螢光變化","View GH146 imaging →":"查看 GH146 影像 →","The complete recordings, regional measurements and interpretation are collected in":"完整影片、區域量測與解讀集中於","documents preparation and analysis.":"記錄製備與分析方法。","TH was imaged from the fly's left side and GH146 from its right side. Image left is posterior; image right is anterior.":"TH 從果蠅本身的左側拍攝，GH146 從右側拍攝。影像左方為尾端，右方為頭端。","Recorded viewing sides and image orientation. The actual measurement regions are outlined on the acquired images in Results; this key identifies viewing direction.":"拍攝側與影像方向。Results 的實拍影像標出實際量測區域；此圖說明觀察方向。","See the recordings, ROI maps and fluorescence results":"查看影片、ROI 區域與螢光結果","Our recordings":"我們的實拍結果","Original olfactory circuit schematic with dashed TH and GH146 imaging-context boxes near the dopamine and projection-neuron regions.":"原有嗅覺神經迴路示意圖，以虛線框在多巴胺神經與投射神經元附近標示 TH 與 GH146 的概略拍攝脈絡。","Dashed boxes mark approximate TH and GH146 imaging context on the circuit schematic; left and right describe the viewing side.":"虛線框在迴路示意圖中標出 TH 與 GH146 的概略拍攝脈絡；左右指拍攝方位。","Open the TH-GFP recording and complete analysis":"開啟 TH-GFP 影片與完整分析","Open the GH146 recordings and complete analysis":"開啟 GH146 影片與完整分析","Recorded TH-GFP fluorescence field":"TH-GFP 實拍螢光影像","Recorded GH146-GCaMP6f fluorescence field from run 02":"GH146-GCaMP6f 第 02 次實拍螢光影像","TH-GFP whole-image fluorescence over the 132-second acquisition with three odor intervals":"TH-GFP 全畫面螢光曲線，呈現 132 秒拍攝與三段給味時程","GH146 run 02 whole-image fluorescence over the 132-second acquisition with three odor intervals":"GH146 第 02 次的全畫面螢光曲線，呈現 132 秒拍攝與三段給味時程","Membrane-labeled structures and the ImageJ-corrected whole-image GFP trace.":"膜標記結構與經 ImageJ 校正的全畫面 GFP 強度曲線。","Recording and regional analysis →":"影片與區域分析 →","Run 02: the representative field and its whole-image fluorescence trace.":"第 02 次：代表視野及其全畫面螢光強度曲線。","All three runs and regional analysis →":"三次拍攝與完整區域分析 →","Each curve is divided by its own mean fluorescence at 8–16 s. Blue intervals mark odor delivery; the horizontal axis shows acquisition time.":"每條曲線除以自身 8–16 秒的平均螢光值。藍色區間為給味時段，橫軸採實際拍攝時間。","Recordings and regional traces":"影片與完整區域曲線","Recorded preparations":"拍攝樣本","GH146 · run 04":"GH146 · 第 04 次","The recordings play directly below. All measured regions remain in the plots; the acquisition clock spans 132 s, while playback takes 116 s.":"下方可直接播放影片。圖中保留全部量測區域；實際拍攝長度為 132 秒，加速播放長度為 116 秒。","GH146: repeated odors":"GH146：重複給味","GH146: four additional odors":"GH146：另外四種氣味","GH146, run 03. Isopentyl acetate, 3-octanol and 4-methylcyclohexanol.":"GH146 第 03 次。乙酸異戊酯、3-辛醇與 4-甲基環己醇。","Run 03: original ImageJ measurement regions.":"第 03 次：原始 ImageJ 量測區域。","GH146 run 03 with four colored measurement regions and posterior to anterior orientation":"GH146 第 03 次：四個彩色量測區域，以及從尾側至頭側的方向","Run 04: raw fluorescence in every measured region over the complete recording.":"第 04 次：全部量測區域在完整拍攝期間的原始螢光強度。","GH146 run 04 full regional raw fluorescence traces":"GH146 第 04 次的全部區域原始螢光曲線","GH146 run 03 recording":"GH146 第 03 次影片","First frame of GH146 run 03 recording":"GH146 第 03 次影片的第一幀","Acquisition time":"取像時間","GH146 run 04 recording":"GH146 紀錄 04","Complete GH146 run 04 fluorescence traces for all measured regions":"GH146 第 04 次所有量測區域的完整螢光曲線","First frame of TH-GFP recording":"TH-GFP 紀錄的第一個影格","Loading light-sheet frames…":"正在載入光片影格…","TH-GFP local baseline fluorescence changes during the three odor windows":"TH-GFP local baseline fluorescence changes during the three odor windows","Odor off":"未給味","3-Octanol":"3-辛醇","Local-baseline GFP fluorescence changes use the same physical odor windows. These traces describe the membrane label.":"以局部基線計算 GFP 螢光變化，給味時段採用相同的實驗秒數。曲線描述膜標記的螢光。","Raw and ImageJ-corrected TH-GFP regional intensity on the 132 second acquisition timeline":"Raw and ImageJ-corrected TH-GFP regional intensity on the 132 second acquisition timeline","Regional local baseline fluorescence changes during four odors in GH146 run 04":"區域局部基線螢光變化 during four odors in GH146 紀錄 04","TH-GFP: the membrane label reveals structures in the recorded left-side field.":"TH-GFP：膜標記呈現左側拍攝視野中的構造。","Valeric acid":"戊酸","Ethyl propionate":"丙酸乙酯","TH regional GFP intensity before and after the supplied ImageJ correction, plotted against acquisition time. Shading marks the three odor windows.":"TH 區域 GFP 強度，分別呈現提供的 ImageJ 校正前後數據，橫軸為實際取像時間。色塊標出三個給味時段。","Recording paused outside the reading area. Select Play to continue.":"影片離開閱讀範圍後已暫停，按播放繼續。","4-Methylcyclohexanol":"4-甲基環己醇","2-Heptanone":"2-庚酮","Isopentyl acetate":"乙酸異戊酯","GH146, run 04. Ethyl propionate, benzaldehyde, 2-heptanone and valeric acid.":"GH146，紀錄 04。依序給予 ethyl propionate、benzaldehyde、2-heptanone 與 valeric acid。","Run 04 across the full 132 s, including all four odor intervals.":"第 04 次的完整 132 秒曲線，包含四段給味時程。","Acquisition clock · playback at 6 frames/s":"取像時間軸 · 每秒播放 6 影格","Benzaldehyde":"苯甲醛","TH-GFP recording":"TH-GFP 影片","First frame of GH146 run 04 recording":"GH146 紀錄 04的第一個影格","Run 04: four odor windows. The valeric-acid recording ends at stimulus offset, so this trace has no recovery period.":"紀錄 04 的四個給味時段。valeric acid 的給味結束時也結束取像，因此沒有給味後的恢復紀錄。","Recording paused. Select Play to continue.":"影片已暫停，按播放繼續。","Pause light-sheet recording":"暫停光片紀錄","Original AVI":"原始 AVI","GH146 · run 03":"GH146 · 第 03 次","GH146: three odors":"GH146：三種氣味","GH146: four odors":"GH146：四種氣味","Three odors":"三種氣味","Four odors":"四種氣味","GCaMP6f provides a calcium-sensitive optical readout. The two recordings shown here cover seven odors in the same fly’s right-side field.":"GCaMP6f 提供鈣離子敏感的光學讀出。下方兩段記錄涵蓋七種氣味，均來自同一隻果蠅右側的拍攝區域。","2 recordings":"2 段記錄","Seven odors in runs 03 and 04":"第 03、04 次記錄，共七種氣味","Regional fluorescence changes varied across odors and image regions.":"各氣味與影像區域的螢光變化不同。","In run 03, the whole-image mean ΔF/F₀ was +0.88% for isopentyl acetate, +0.99% for 3-octanol and +0.63% for 4-methylcyclohexanol. Run 04 adds four other odors.":"第 03 次記錄中，全影像平均 ΔF/F₀ 在乙酸異戊酯給味期間為 +0.88%，3-辛醇為 +0.99%，4-甲基環己醇為 +0.63%。第 04 次記錄涵蓋另外四種氣味。","Runs 03 and 04 come from the same female fly. Each recording pairs the movie with odor-aligned regional changes and a complete intensity time course.":"第 03、04 次記錄來自同一隻雌性果蠅。每組皆呈現影片、對齊給味時間的區域變化，以及完整螢光強度曲線。","Odor-window measurements":"給味期間的量測結果","These measurements describe regional fluorescence during seven odor presentations in one fly; the two recordings are not independent biological replicates.":"這些數據呈現同一隻果蠅在七種氣味給味期間的區域螢光變化；兩段記錄不視為獨立生物重複。","Imaging and analysis methods":"影像與分析方法","GH146 run 03: local baseline fluorescence changes in all five measured regions, one panel per odor":"GH146 第 03 次：五個量測區域相對局部基線的螢光變化，每種氣味各一張圖","GH146 run 03: complete 132 second raw fluorescence traces for all five measured regions":"GH146 第 03 次：五個量測區域的完整 132 秒原始螢光強度曲線","Run 03: regional ΔF/F₀ around each odor presentation. Each panel uses the preceding local baseline; blue shading marks odor delivery.":"第 03 次：各氣味給味前後的區域 ΔF/F₀。每張圖均採用給味前的局部基線；藍色區間標示給味時間。","Run 03: fluorescence intensity in all measured regions across the full 132 s. Blue shading marks odor delivery; the dashed line is the whole-image mean.":"第 03 次：全部量測區域的完整 132 秒螢光強度。藍色區間標示給味時間，虛線為全影像平均值。","GH146 run 04: local baseline fluorescence changes in all five measured regions, one panel per odor":"GH146 第 04 次：五個量測區域相對局部基線的螢光變化，每種氣味各一張圖","GH146 run 04: complete 132 second raw fluorescence traces for all five measured regions":"GH146 第 04 次：五個量測區域的完整 132 秒原始螢光強度曲線","Run 04: regional ΔF/F₀ around each odor presentation. Each panel uses the preceding local baseline; blue shading marks odor delivery. The valeric-acid trace ends at stimulus offset.":"第 04 次：各氣味給味前後的區域 ΔF/F₀。每張圖均採用給味前的局部基線；藍色區間標示給味時間。 戊酸的記錄於給味結束時停止。","Run 04: fluorescence intensity in all measured regions across the full 132 s. Blue shading marks odor delivery; the dashed line is the whole-image mean.":"第 04 次：全部量測區域的完整 132 秒螢光強度。藍色區間標示給味時間，虛線為全影像平均值。","TH-GFP: ΔF/F₀ after ImageJ bleaching correction across the full 132 s. Each region uses its own 8–16 s mean as F₀. Blue shading marks odor delivery; the dashed line represents the whole image.":"TH-GFP：ImageJ 漂白校正後的完整 132 秒 ΔF/F₀。各區域以自身 8–16 秒的平均值作為 F₀。藍色區間標示給味時間，虛線代表全影像。","Run 03: regional ΔF/F₀ across the full 132 s. Each region uses its own 8–16 s mean as F₀. Blue shading marks odor delivery; the dashed line represents the whole image.":"第 03 次：各區域完整 132 秒的 ΔF/F₀。各區域以自身 8–16 秒的平均值作為 F₀。藍色區間標示給味時間，虛線代表全影像。","Run 04: regional ΔF/F₀ across the full 132 s. Each region uses its own 8–16 s mean as F₀. Blue shading marks odor delivery; the dashed line represents the whole image.":"第 04 次：各區域完整 132 秒的 ΔF/F₀。各區域以自身 8–16 秒的平均值作為 F₀。藍色區間標示給味時間，虛線代表全影像。","TH-GFP bleaching-corrected ΔF/F₀ for five regions and the whole image over 132 seconds":"TH-GFP 漂白校正後的完整 132 秒 ΔF/F₀，包含五個區域與全影像","GH146 run 03: complete 132 second ΔF/F₀ traces for all five measured regions":"GH146 第 03 次：五個量測區域的完整 132 秒 ΔF/F₀ 曲線","GH146 run 04: complete 132 second ΔF/F₀ traces for all five measured regions":"GH146 第 04 次：五個量測區域的完整 132 秒 ΔF/F₀ 曲線","TH-GFP: regional ΔF/F₀ from bleaching-corrected fluorescence around the three odor windows, using a separate pre-odor baseline for each panel.":"TH-GFP：以漂白校正後的螢光計算三次給味前後的區域 ΔF/F₀；每張圖分別採用該次給味前的基線。","From inspiration to observation":"從啟發到觀察","In a GH146-GCaMP6f recording, fluorescence changes differed across image regions during three odor presentations. This observation connects the biological inspiration to our choice of an optical readout.":"GH146-GCaMP6f 的一段記錄顯示，在三種氣味給味期間，不同影像區域的螢光變化各異。這項觀察將生物啟發與我們選擇的光學讀出方式連結起來。","Explore all TH and GH146 results: videos, ΔF/F₀ and ROI maps":"查看完整 TH 與 GH146 結果：影片、ΔF/F₀ 與 ROI 圖","GCaMP6f provides a calcium-sensitive optical readout. The complete dataset covers seven odors in two recordings from the same fly’s right-side field.":"GCaMP6f 提供鈣離子敏感的光學讀出。完整資料包含同一隻果蠅右側拍攝區域的兩段記錄，涵蓋七種氣味。","Fly brain imaging":"果蠅腦影像","01 · Biological inspiration":"01 · 生物啟發","Our biological starting point was the fly olfactory system. Light-sheet recordings show labeled TH-GFP structures and regional GH146-GCaMP6f fluorescence during odor presentation. The engineered HEK293 experiments follow in the next sections.":"果蠅嗅覺系統是我們的生物啟發起點。光片記錄呈現 TH-GFP 標記的結構，以及 GH146-GCaMP6f 在給味期間的區域螢光變化。後續章節再呈現工程化 HEK293 細胞的實驗結果。","Runs 03 and 04 come from the same female fly. Each recording pairs the movie with odor-aligned regional ΔF/F₀ and a complete 132 s time course.":"第 03、04 次記錄來自同一隻雌性果蠅。每組皆呈現影片、對齊給味時間的區域 ΔF/F₀，以及完整 132 秒曲線。","The 5137;TH preparation carries membrane-targeted mCD8::GFP. Its movie documents labeled structures; the regional ΔF/F₀ curves use the supplied ImageJ bleaching-corrected measurements.":"5137;TH 使用膜定位的 mCD8::GFP。影片呈現標記的結構；區域 ΔF/F₀ 曲線採用原有 ImageJ 漂白校正後的量測值。","3 recordings · ΔF/F₀ · measured regions":"3 段記錄 · ΔF/F₀ · 量測區域","02 · Colony plates":"02 · 菌落平板","03 · DNA electrophoresis":"03 · DNA 電泳","04 · Transfection efficiency":"04 · 轉染效率","05 · Odor testing · P2":"05 · 氣味測試 · P2","GH146 · three odors":"GH146 · 三種氣味","GH146 · four odors":"GH146 · 四種氣味","TH ΔF/F₀ curves use the supplied ImageJ bleaching-corrected ROI values. The correction used an exponential fit to the tissue-reference ROI named background. Original and corrected measurements remain in the source data.":"TH 的 ΔF/F₀ 曲線採用原有 ImageJ 漂白校正後的 ROI 數值。該校正以名為 background 的組織參考 ROI 進行指數擬合；原始與校正後量測值均保留於來源資料。","For the full 132 s curves, each ROI uses its own mean over 8 ≤ t < 16 s as F₀, with ΔF/F₀ (%) = 100 × (F − F₀) / F₀. TH uses bleaching-corrected measurements and GH146 uses the original regional means. These full-recording baselines stay fixed; the odor-aligned panels use the local baselines above. All curves are unsmoothed.":"完整 132 秒曲線以各 ROI 在 8 ≤ t < 16 秒的平均值作為 F₀，並計算 ΔF/F₀ (%) = 100 × (F − F₀) / F₀。TH 採用漂白校正後量測值，GH146 採用原始區域平均值。全程曲線的基線固定不變；對齊給味時間的分圖則採用上述局部基線。所有曲線均未平滑。","TH-GFP · isopentyl acetate, 3-octanol and 4-methylcyclohexanol.":"TH-GFP · 乙酸異戊酯、3-辛醇與 4-甲基環己醇。","GH146-GCaMP6f · isopentyl acetate, 3-octanol and 4-methylcyclohexanol.":"GH146-GCaMP6f · 乙酸異戊酯、3-辛醇與 4-甲基環己醇。","GH146-GCaMP6f · ethyl propionate, benzaldehyde, 2-heptanone and valeric acid.":"GH146-GCaMP6f · 丙酸乙酯、苯甲醛、2-庚酮與戊酸。","GH146-GCaMP6f recording with three odors":"GH146-GCaMP6f 三種氣味影片","GH146-GCaMP6f recording with four odors":"GH146-GCaMP6f 四種氣味影片","First frame: TH-GFP recording":"TH-GFP 影片第一幀","First frame: GH146-GCaMP6f recording with three odors":"GH146-GCaMP6f 三種氣味影片第一幀","First frame: GH146-GCaMP6f recording with four odors":"GH146-GCaMP6f 四種氣味影片第一幀","We used light-sheet microscopy to connect our olfactory inspiration with an optical measurement. TH-GFP reveals labeled structures; GH146-GCaMP6f records regional fluorescence during seven odor presentations. The two GH146 recordings come from the same fly.":"我們以光片顯微鏡將嗅覺啟發連結到光學量測。TH-GFP 呈現標記的結構；GH146-GCaMP6f 記錄七種氣味給味期間的區域螢光。兩段 GH146 影片來自同一隻果蠅。","Complete ΔF/F₀ time courses. TH uses bleaching-corrected fluorescence; each curve is normalized to its own 8–16 s mean. Blue bands mark odor delivery. Solid curves are image regions; black dashed curves are whole-image means.":"完整 ΔF/F₀ 時間曲線。TH 採用漂白校正後螢光；每條曲線以自身 8–16 秒的平均值正規化。藍色區間為給味時間，實線為影像區域，黑色虛線為全影像平均值。","Complete 132 second ΔF/F₀ comparison of TH-GFP and both GH146-GCaMP6f odor panels":"TH-GFP 與兩組 GH146-GCaMP6f 的完整 132 秒 ΔF/F₀ 比較","In the shared three-odor sequence, the middle and upper GH146 regions showed mean local ΔF/F₀ changes of +1.73% to +2.67%, while the right region ranged from −0.61% to +0.48%. Across the four additional odor windows, regional means ranged from −1.00% to +1.56%. The odor-aligned curves below show these spatial differences.":"在共同的三種氣味程序中，GH146 中央與上方區域的平均局部 ΔF/F₀ 為 +1.73% 至 +2.67%，右側區域則為 −0.61% 至 +0.48%。另外四種氣味給味期間，各區域的平均值介於 −1.00% 與 +1.56%。下方對齊給味時間的曲線呈現這些空間差異。","TH-GFP and GH146-GCaMP6f regional ΔF/F₀ aligned to the same three odor presentations":"TH-GFP 與 GH146-GCaMP6f 對齊相同三種氣味給味時間的區域 ΔF/F₀","Shared odors, aligned to stimulus onset. Each panel uses its own pre-odor baseline. TH-GFP and GH146-GCaMP6f report different fluorescence signals; their amplitudes are not a comparison of neuronal sensitivity.":"共同氣味，以給味開始時間對齊。每張圖各自採用給味前基線。TH-GFP 與 GH146-GCaMP6f 記錄不同螢光訊號，其振幅不作為神經敏感度的比較。","GH146-GCaMP6f regional ΔF/F₀ during ethyl propionate, benzaldehyde, 2-heptanone and valeric acid":"GH146-GCaMP6f 在丙酸乙酯、苯甲醛、2-庚酮及戊酸給味期間的區域 ΔF/F₀","Four additional odors in GH146-GCaMP6f. The same local-baseline calculation is used for each odor; the valeric-acid recording ends at stimulus offset.":"GH146-GCaMP6f 的另外四種氣味。各氣味使用相同的局部基線計算法；戊酸記錄於給味結束時停止。","TH-GFP and both GH146-GCaMP6f imaging fields with measured regions and one shared posterior-to-anterior direction arrow":"TH-GFP 與兩組 GH146-GCaMP6f 的實拍區域及量測框，共用一個由尾側指向頭側的方向箭頭","Measured regions on the original images. All three images run from posterior at left to anterior at right. ROI names describe image positions; the colors match the curves.":"原始影像上的量測區域。三張圖皆為左側朝尾、右側朝頭；ROI 名稱代表影像位置，顏色與曲線一致。","Figures and source data":"圖表與來源資料","GH146-GCaMP6f regional ΔF/F₀ during the three-odor sequence":"GH146-GCaMP6f 三種氣味程序中的區域 ΔF/F₀","GH146-GCaMP6f: regional ΔF/F₀ around each odor presentation. Each panel uses its own pre-odor baseline; blue shading marks odor delivery.":"GH146-GCaMP6f：各次給味前後的區域 ΔF/F₀。每張圖各自採用給味前的基線，藍色區間標示給味時間。","TH-GFP records membrane-labeled neuronal fluorescence. GH146 × UAS-GCaMP6f records calcium-sensitive fluorescence in the GH146 expression domain. The GH146 analysis covers two recordings from one female fly: a three-odor sequence and a four-odor sequence.":"TH-GFP 記錄膜標記的神經螢光；GH146 × UAS-GCaMP6f 記錄 GH146 表現區域中的鈣離子敏感螢光。GH146 分析涵蓋同一隻雌性果蠅的兩段記錄，分別為三種及四種氣味程序。","TH-GFP and GH146: three odors":"TH-GFP 與 GH146：三種氣味","For each odor, F₀ is the mean fluorescence over the 8 s window ending 2 s before stimulus onset. Local ΔF/F₀ (%) = 100 × (F − F₀) / F₀. The common protocol therefore uses baselines of 10–18, 50–58 and 90–98 s. The four-odor GH146 sequence uses 10–18, 45–53, 80–88 and 110–118 s.":"各氣味的 F₀ 為給味前 2 秒結束、長度 8 秒的螢光平均值。局部 ΔF/F₀ (%) = 100 × (F − F₀) / F₀。共同三種氣味程序的基線為 10–18、50–58、90–98 秒；GH146 四種氣味程序則為 10–18、45–53、80–88、110–118 秒。","Follow the signal":"追蹤訊號","The problem":"問題背景","Four chapters":"四個章節","Why biological olfaction":"為何選擇生物嗅覺","Sense → Read → Decode → Act":"感測 → 讀取 → 解碼 → 行動","What we build on":"研究基礎","Layer dependencies":"各層的依賴關係","Human Practices":"人類實踐","Interpreting a result":"解讀結果","References":"參考資料","Download AVI":"下載 AVI","The web player could not load. The recording download remains available below.":"網頁播放器無法載入。仍可使用下方連結下載影片。"});
